{"id": "18329", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18329", "title": "Kenny k shot", "text": "Ubuzima.\nUyu musore Kenny k shot kumyaka ye 23 yarasoje amashuri y'isumbuye mw'ishami ry'imibare,ubukungu n'ubumenyi bw'isi (MEG).\nAmateka.\nUmuhanzi Kenny k shot uzwi mwitsinda rya Trapish n'umwe mubakunzwe cyane mu Rwanda akaba akomeje kw'igarurira imitima ya benshi murwanda.\nYakunzwe cyane kundirimbo ye nziza yitwa Intare,ibitambo,I Gotta GO,chap chap n'izindi nyinshi cyane.\nUyu musore akomeje gukora birenze mu bitaramo ya koranye nabagenzi be."}
{"id": "18330", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18330", "title": "Pastor theogene", "text": "PASTOR THEOGENNEHeading text.\nPasiteri Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne Niyonshuti wo mu Rwanda, wari uzwi cyane mu biganiro byo kuri YouTube, yapfuye azize impanuka, nkuko bivugwa n'umukuru w'itorero.\nUmushumba mukuru w'itorero rya pantekoti ry'u Rwanda (ADEPR), Pasiteri Isa\u00efe Ndayizeye, yabwiye BBC Gahuzamiryango ko iby'urupfu rwe muri 2023 rwababaje abantu benshi\nYavuze ko Pasiteri Th\u00e9o yapfiriye mu mpanuka y'imodoka i Kabale, mu burengerazuba bwa Uganda.\nakaba ari umwe muba pasiteri bari bakunzwe murwanda"}
{"id": "18331", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18331", "title": "The nature", "text": "Mugisha Prince uzwi kw'izina rya the Nature, numuhanzi winjiye mu muziki nyuma yo kubona abamufasha asohora extended play(EP) ye yambere. uyu muhanzi yavutse tariki 2 ukuboza 1999, akaba avuka mumuryango wabana babiri akaba yarasoje amashuri yisumbuye.\nUyu muhanzi numwe mubahanzi bafite abavandimwe mu muziki barimo umuraperi ish kevin, logan joe. The nature avugako yakuze ashaka kuzaba umukinnyi wumupira ariko impano yumuziki niyo yabashije gukunda akayikurikirana.avugako ku myaka 15 aribwo yatangiye kwiyumvamo impano y'umuziki n'ababyeyi be bamubwirako bazamushyigikira.\nThe nature yavuze murwego rwo rwo kwinjira mu muziki neza, yahisemo gufata umwanya uhagije kugirango atunganye EP ye yambere yise \"umva vibe\". Irimo indirimbo nka:' waitress' yakoranye na gabiro guitar, 'mfatirana','slay', ndetse na chance. The nature avugako gukorana EP ye yambere na gabiro guitar byaturutse kubushuti bari basanzwe bafitanye. Uyu muhanzi The nature akaba asaba aba nyarwanda gukomeza kumushyigikira murugendo rwe rw'umuziki."}
