{"id": "18333", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18333", "title": "Umukandara", "text": "Umukandara ni umwenda umuntu yambara kugirango ufate ipantaro cyangwa ijipo itamanuka.ariko hakaba hari numukandara wo mumodoka\nuyu mukandara wo mumodoka umuntu iyo agiye kurugendo ari mumodoka arawambara uvuye mukwaha ukagera kurutugu ariko uyu mukandara ufashe kumodoka\nAkamaro k'umukandara wo mumodoka.\nuyu mukandara wo mumodoka wifashishwa kugirango urinde umugenzi ndetse numushoferi kuba yahura n'impanuka igihe imodoka iri kwihuta ndetse nigihe imodoka igeze ahantu hahanamye\nuyu mukandara akamaro kawo kagereranwa nakamaro kingofero umuntu yambara iyo ari kuri moto kubwizo mpamvu police y'u RWANDA ishishikariza abantu kwambara uyu mukandara igihe cyose bari murugendo rw'imodoka \nIbihano bihabwa abatubahiriza aya mabwiriza.\nAbagenzi ndetse n'abashoferi batubahiriza aya mabwiriza yo kwambara umukandara n'ingofero igihe bari kurugendo,iyo bafashwe bacibwa amande ndetse bagahabwa n'igifungo igihe bibaye ngombwa"}
{"id": "18334", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18334", "title": "MUHIRE KEVIN", "text": "MUHIRE Kevin n' umusore ukina umupira w'amaguru nk'uwabigize umwuga mu ikipe ya rayon sport akaba akina inyuma yaba rutahizamu ahazwi nko kuri no 10 ikindi akaba afite inshingano zo kuba kapiteni w' ikipe akinamo ya Rayon Sport.\nKapiteni wa Rayon Sports, Kevin Muhire, yemeje ko umukino wa nyuma w\u2019umunsi wa 30 bazakina na Kiyovu Sports ku wa gatandatu, tariki ya 11 Gicurasi uzaba umukino we wa nyuma muri iyi kipe.\nUyu mukinnyi mpuzamahanga w\u2019u Rwanda winjiye muri Murera mu Kwakira 2023 ku masezerano y\u2019igihe gito, yatangaje ko yamaze kugirana amasezerano n\u2019ikipe yo hanze y\u2019u Rwanda kandi ko yiteguye kuva muri iyi kipe ubwo shampiyona iraba irangiye.\nAganira na Radio&amp;TV 10, Kevin Muhire yemeje ko agiye kuva muri Rayon Sports, aho yagize ati: \"Sinzagumana na Rayon Sports; Nzakina umukino wanjye wa nyuma muri iyi kipe kuri uyu wa gatandatu.\n\"Muhire kevin yongereye amasezerano mu ikipe ya rayon sport\".\nMuhire kevin ni umukinnyi wikipe Rayon-sport mu Rwanda uyumukinnyi abafana Murera batagiyekwibaza\nniba azakomeza gukinira iyikipe nyumayo gustindwa na APR FC ibitego2-0 bakabatwara igikombe cyamahoro ariko biravugwako\nyaragije kumvikana ni kipe ya rayon-sport ko azaguma mwikipe akabayasinye amasezerano azamara imyaka ibiri kandi uyumusore mwimyaka 26 y'amavuko akaba yarivugiye ko nayindikipe azakinira mu Rwanda cyereste ayjiyehanze y'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "18335", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18335", "title": "Umwuko", "text": "Umwuko ni cyimwe mu nigikoresho gikozwe mugiti Kenshi ukaba wifashishwa mugikoni barimo guteka ibiryo bitandukanye. Umwuko ukorwa mu biti bitandukanye ariko biba byiza iyo ubajwe mu giti cyinturusu kuko nibwo uba ukomeye.\numwuko ushobora gukoreshwa uteka akawunga,ubugari,igikoma,isosi."}
{"id": "18336", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18336", "title": "Rema", "text": "Divine Ikubor (yavutse ku ya 1 Gicurasi 2000), uzwi ku izina rya Rema, ni umuririmbyi n\u2019umuraperi wo muri Nijeriya. Yamenyekanye bwa mbere mu 2019 kubera indirimbo ye \"Dumebi\", muri uwo mwaka kandi ubwo yasinyaga mu itsinda rya D\u2019Prince, Jonzing World. Ku rwego mpuzamahanga, yamenyekanye cyane muri 2022 n\u2019indirimbo ye \"Calm Down\", ndetse isubirwamo n\u2019umuririmbyi w\u2019umunyamerika Selena Gomez, igera ku mwanya wa gatatu ku rutonde rwa Billboard Hot 100. Rema kandi yayoboye urutonde rwa Billboard Afrobeats amaraho ibyumweru 58.\nMuri uwo mwaka, yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye, \"Rave &amp; Roses\" (2022), igera ku mwanya wa 81 kuri Billboard 200. Alubumu ye ya kabiri yitwa Heis yayisohoye muri 2024 yafashijwemo na Benin Boys. Knadi anahamagarwa muri kuri Alubumu nziza ku isi mu birori bya 67 bya \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nDivine Ikubor yavutse ku ya 1 Gicurasi 2000 mu muryango wa gikirisitu mu mujyi wa Benin, muri Leta ya Edo, muri Nijeriya. Akomoka muri Igbanke muri Orhionmwon LGA yo muri leta ya Edo. Yavumbuye umuhamagaro we wo muri muzika mu mashuri yisumbuye mu ishuri rya Ighile Group of School muri Leta ya Edo, ari naho yatangiye kuririmba no gucuranga. Nyuma yo kubura se na mukuru we, Rema yarezwe na nyina, wagize uruhare runini mu guhindura ubuzima bwe. \nUmwuga.\n2019\u20132021: Gutangira umwuga no kwandika inyandiko.\nRema yatangiye umwuga we wa muzika akora ibitaramo mu nsengero hamwe na mugenzi we Alpha P mu mwaka wa 2019. Yamenyekanye nyuma yo gushyira hanze agace gato ari kuririmba kuri Instagram ku ndirimbo ya 'Gucci Gang' ya D'Prince. D'Prince yatangajwe n'ubuhanga bwe, amujyana i Lagos maze amuha amasezerano yo gukorana na Jonzing World, ishami rya Mavin Records ifitwe n'umuyobozi wa muzika akaba na producer Don Jazzy. Muri 2019, Rema yasohoye izina umuzingo we mbere witwa \"Rema\", uza ku isonga rya Apple Music muri Nigeriya.] Nyuma yi mpeshyi, indi ndirimbo izwi cyane kuri uwo muzingo yagaragaye ku rutonde rw\u2019indirimbo zuwahoze ari Perezida wa Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika, Barack Obama. 2020, indirimbo za Rema zashyizwe ku majwi ya \"FIFA 21\". Muri Nzeri 2021, yashyizwe ahagaragara nka ambasaderi w\u2019ikirango wa Pepsi, ari kumwe na mugenzi we wumuhanzikazi witwa Ayra Starr. \nToya Delazy, umuhanzi utunganya umuziki akaba n\u2019umuhanzi wo muri Afurika yepfo, yatangije injyana ya \"Afrorave\" mu 2019, ahuza ibintu bya garage, amagambo y\u2019Abazulu, n\u2019ubundi buryo bwa Afurika. Muri Gicurasi 2021, Rema yakoresheje ijambo \"Afrorave\" kugira ngo asobanure umuziki we bwite, uhuza Afrobeats n\u2019Abarabu n\u2019Abahinde. Iri jwi ritandukanye ryumvikanye nabafana, rimuhesha umufana wihariye uzwi nka Ravers. \n2022 \u2013 23: \"Rave &amp; Roses\" na \"Ravage\" EP.\nNyuma yo gusohora Iimizingo itatu, Rema yerekanye alubumu ye ya mbere, \"Rave &amp; Roses\", ku ya 25 Werurwe 2022, munsi ya Jonzing World. Iyi alubumu irimo indirimbo 16, zirimo ubufatanye na 6lack, Chris Brown, AJ Tracey, na Yseult. Yaririho indirimbo 10 ku mbonerahamwe \"ya Billboard\" Afrobeats yo muri Amerika mu cyumweru cyayo cya mbere. \" Gutuza \" yamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga, igera ku mwanya wa 3 kuri Billboard Hot 100 nyuma yo gusubiramo hamwe na Selena Gomez, ikuraho amateka menshi. 5 Muri Gashyantare 2023, yatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019umuhanzi w\u2019umwaka wa Digital mu bihembo bya Soundcity MVP byabereye mu kigo cya Eko Convention Centre i Lagos. Muri Mata 2023, yasohoye \"Rave &amp; Roses Ultra\", ibaye alubumu ya mbere nyafurika yambutse miliyari ebyiri kuri Spotify. Ku ya 26 Ukwakira 2023, Rema yasohoye \"Ravage\" EP, maze ku ya 30 Ukwakira 2023, akora ibitaramo mu muhango wa Ballon d'or wabereye Theatre du Ch\u00e2telet i Paris mu Bufaransa. \n2024: Album ya kabiri ya Studio; HEIS.\nKu ya 11 Nyakanga 2024, Rema yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya kabiri ya studio yitwa HEIS. Umutwe wa alubumu wakomotse ku ijambo ry'Ikigereki rivuga \"numero 1\". Yerekana Rema ufite izina rye, \"Igikomangoma cya Afrobeats\". Iyi alubumu igizwe n'indirimbo 11 igaragaramo ijwi ryijimye, ritwarwa n'ingoma ugereranije na alubumu ye ya mbere, Rave &amp; Roses. Rema avuga ko ubu buryo bushya muri muzika ye ari \" afro-rave \" asobanura ko \"[we ubwe yiyumvisha Afrobeats,\" mu kiganiro yagiranye na HOT 97 mu 2022. Ijwi ni uruvange rw'ubwoko butandukanye kuva Afrobeats, inzu, hip-hop, n'imbyino. HEIS ifite byinshi yerekana kumico kavukire ya Edo kandi yerekana ubushakashatsi ku nsanganyamatsiko yo gushimira umuco no kwiyemeza gushimisha abateze amatwi bituma bayifata nkirimo abadayimoni. Nubwo yanenzwe hakiri kare, HEIS yagaragaye ku mwanya wa 2 ku mbonerahamwe ya Top 100 ya Album, nyuma igera ku mwanya wa mbere, kandi imaze ibyumweru 29 iri ku mbonerahamwe hamwe no gcurangwa isnhuro miliyoni 104. Byongeye kandi, alubumu ya kabiri yakiriye Grammy nomination ya Rema kuri Album nziza yumuziki wisi yose yaranze nomero ya mbere ya Grammy ya Rema.\n2025: \"Uruhinja (Nicyaha)\" na \"Bout U.\".\nKu ya 7 Gashyantare 2025, Rema yasohoye indirimbo ' Uruhinja (Ni Icyaha) ' yerekana icyitegererezo cya Sade cyo mu 1985 ' Ni Icyaha '. yaramenyekanye cyane, ihinduka imwe mu ndirimbo zo muri Nigeriya zikunzwe cyane mu 2025.\nKu ya 11 Mata 2025, Rema yasohoye indi ndirimbo yitwa ' Bout U '. \nUbuzima bwite.\nKu ya 28 Nzeri 2020, Rema yanditse ku rubuga rwa Twitter ashinja Ishyaka Riharanira Demokarasi no Kurengera Ibidukikije (PDP) ku ruhare bagize mu rupfu rwa se, Justice Ikubor, wahoze ari umuyobozi w'iryo shyaka. Nubwo Rema yemerewe kwiga muri kaminuza ya Lagos mu 2022, byabaye ngombwa ko ava muri icyo kigo mu 2023 kubera imyigaragambyo y\u2019abakozi ba ASUU ikomeje. \nIngaruka.\n\"Rolling Stone\" yagize ati \"Rema nta gushidikanya kandi yishimye kuba ikimenyetso cy\u2019izamuka rya Afrobeats ku isi.\" Kwandika ku \"munsi w\u2019ubucuruzi\" Anthony Udugba yavuze ko Rema \"yaguye icyerekezo\" cy\u2019umuziki nyafurika ku isi yose. \"Guardian yo muri Nijeriya\" yagize iti \"Mu gihe imiterere ya Afrobeats ikomeje gutera imbere, izamuka rya Rema ryashyizeho urwego rwo hejuru, ryerekana umuziki wa Nijeriya ukunzwe ku isi hose ikunze ndetse ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\" \"Kavukire\" yagize ati \"Ntibishoboka gusiba ikimenyetso yasize ku mateka ya Afrobeats.\" Victor Okpala yagize ati \"Ijwi rya Rema ryashimangiye umwanya we nk'inzira nyabagendwa.\" Abamunenga benshi bamushimye kuba yararenze inzitizi kandi akangurira abandi bahanzi bo muri Afurika. \u201cRema arashimangira umwanya we nk'umwe mu bahanzi bakomeye ba Afrobeat bo mu gisekuru cye, hamwe n'umurage uzibukwa mu myaka iri imbere.\u201d\nIngendo.\nUmutwe"}
