{"id": "18345", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18345", "title": "IKIGO CYA WISEDOM", "text": "= IKIGO CYA WISDOM =\nIkigo cya wisedom ni ishuri riherereye mu majyaruguru y'URWNDA rikaba ryifuza abanyeshuri\nmu mashami atandukanye risanzwe rifite aya masomo;PCB,MCB,MPC,MPG.Iki cyigo kandi \ngifite ishami ry'ubuforomo nibyiciro bitandukanye birimo ikiciro rusange cy'amashuri \ny'isumbuye ayabanza n'ayinshuke intego y'irishuri gutanga uburere bishingiye kuri \nBibiliya umuco, nyarwanda ndetse, n'uburezi Mpuzamahang Umuyobozi ushinzwe amasomo\nya siyansi muri Wisdom School Bizimana Evariste yavuze ko banatanga ubumenyingiro buhagije\nngo umwana uharererwa abe azi neza ibyo yiga abe azi no kubibyaza \n= UMUYOBOZI USHINZWE AMASOMO YA SIYANSI =\nAragira ati&lt; Muri wisdom school twigisha abanyeshuri ku zaba barwiyemezamirimo kubaka abanyeshuri batazaba umutwaro w'igihugu cyangwa uw'imiryango yabo ahubwo bakwiriye kuzaba ibisubizo byibibazo \nby' ugarije Igihugu ndetse n'isi yacu muri rusange. Ni ukuvuga umubyeyi uduhaye "}
{"id": "18346", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18346", "title": "MUHAZI UNITED", "text": "MUHAZI UNITED FC ni ikipe yo mukarere ka Rwamagana ikaba yarahoze yitwa RWAMAGANA City\nnyuma ikaza guhindurirwa izina ikitwa MUHAZI UNITED FC kuberako yari igiye guterwa inkunga n'uturere\ntubiri aritwo RWAMAGANA na KAYONZA.\niyi kipe yongeye gukina shampiyona y'ikiciro cya mbere mu Rwanda nyuma y'imyaka 6 iri mu kiciro\ncya kabiri. Muhazi united yakirira imikino yayo mu karere ka Ngoma kuberako nta Stade igira mukarere kayo \nABAYOBOZI BAMUHAZI UNITED FC:\nPeresida:NKAKA Mfizi\nVIS peresidawambere:UWIMANA Nehemie\nVIS peresida wa kabiri:NDAYIRAGIJE Patrice\nMUHAZI UNITED FC ni ikipe yo mukarere ka RWAMAGANa ikaba yarahoze yitwa RWAMAGANA City\nnyuma ikaza guhindurirwa izina ikitwa MUHAZI UNITED FC kuberako yari igiye guterwa inkunga n'uturere\ntubiri aritwo RWAMAGANA na KAYONZA."}
{"id": "18347", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18347", "title": "Akamaro k'igishanga cy'urugezi", "text": "Akamaro k'igishanga cy'urugezi.\nIgishanga cy'urugezi ni kimwe mu bishanga bifitiye igihugu akamaro kanini, iki gishanga giherereye mu karere ka Burera kikaba gikora ku mirenge ya Butaro, Ruhunde, Kivuye, Gatebe, Rwerere na Miyove yo muri Gicumbi mu ntara y'amajyaruguru. \niki gishanga gifite akamaro gatandukanye kubagituriye ndetse nigihugu muri rusange aha twavuga nko kuba aricyo gitanga amashanyarazi akoreshwa cyane mu gihugu, intaho y'inyamaswa, gitanga amazi, gikurura ba mukerarugendo..."}
