{"id": "18483", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18483", "title": "GAHUNDA YO KURWANYA SIDA", "text": "inzobere muguhangana bw'ubwandu bwa virus itera SIDA zatangije gahunda yo kurwanya SIDA yiswe 90-90-90.\n= INTEGO =\nigamije ko muri 2020 abantu banduye virus itera SIDA 90%bazaba bazi ko banduye90% mubazi ko banduye bafata imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virus itera SIDA,naho 90%mubafata imiti bakaba batacyanduza virus itera SIDA.bavuga ko iyo gahunda iramutse ishyizwe mu bikorwa neza 2020 mu isi SIDA yagabanyuka ku kigero cya 72%,bihwanye na 90%."}
{"id": "18484", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18484", "title": "Amateka ya Perezida Paul Kagame", "text": "Perezida Paul Kagame.\nPaul Kagame ni perezida wa 5 wa Repubulika y'u Rwanda kuva rwabona ubwigenge. Yayoboye kuva 24 Werurwe 2000. Yavukiye hafi y'Umujyi wa Ruhango mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo kuwa 23 Ukwakira 1957 ni umuhererezi mu muryango wabana 6. Ubu aho yavukiye hitwa Umudugudu wa Buhoro.\nUbuyobozi bwa Paul Kagame.\nAmateka ya Perezida Paul Kagame afitanye isoko mu mateka yo kuva mu 1987, ubwo we n'abandi babanaga mu buzima bw'ubuhunzi mu Gihugu cya Uganda, bashinze umuryango FPR Inkotanyi, Perezida Kagame akaba yari mu b'imbere muri FPR, uyu mutwe wa Politiki ukaba ari na wo watangiye kuganirirwamo uko impunzi zari mu mahanga zitahuka. Paul Kagame yayoboye ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi zihagarika Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Kuva yajya ku buyobozi yagaruye amahoro. Ku buryo yateje imbere igihugu cyari cyarashegeshwe na genoside.\nNyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi u Rwana rumaze kubohorwa, Perezida Kagame yakomeje kuba mu batekerereza Igihugu uko u Rwanda rwakongera kwiyubaka.\nAmateka ya Perezida Paul Kagame agabanyijemo mu byiciro bine. Icya mbere kivuga ku buzizma bwe bwite, Ku masomo ya gisirikare, uko yinjiye mu ruhando mpuzamahanga n'uko yabaye perezida w'u Rwanda.\nIcyiciro cya kabiri kivuga uburyo u Rwanda rwateye imbere ku buyobozi bwe no mw'iterambere ry'Abanyarwanda muri rusange. Perezida Kagame aherutse kuza ku rutonde rw'abaperesida b'Abanyafurika bavugwa cyane mubitangazamakuru bitandukanye mu isi yose kubera noguhabwa ibihembo byuko yateje imbere ikoranabuhanga mu Rwanda."}
