{"id": "18576", "revid": "13494", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18576", "title": "Umunyeshuri", "text": "Umunyeshuri mushya.\nIyo umunyeshuri agiye kwiga ku kigo bwa mbere nibwo yitwa ko ari umunyeshuri mushya muri icyo kigo. umunyeshuri iyo ari mushya akunze kugira imbogamizi nyinshi cyane zimwe muri zo usanga ashobora kwigunga kubera ko aba ari nta muntu abasha kwisanzuraho ngo abe yaganira nawe. kwiga usanga bimugora kuko aba ataramenya uwo yabaza ibyo atabashije gufatira ku kibaho cyangwa yibagiwe ndetse akunze no guhura nikibazo cyo kuba ataramenyera imyigishirize y'ikigo ndetse n'amategeko yacyo. bityo rero sibyiza ko umunyeshuri yasimburanya ibigo kenshi cyane cyane umunyeshuri w'itegura ikizamini cya reta."}
{"id": "18577", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18577", "title": "UMUCYO Elise", "text": "Amateka.\nUyu mwana w'umukobwa utuye mu karere ka Huye mu majyepfo y'igihugu cy'u Rwanda umukobwa w\u2019imyaka 21 arangije amashuri y'isumbuye mu ntara y'amagepfo akaba yarakunze cyane ibikorwaremezo guhera mubuto bwe.\nIbikorwa.\nUyu mukobwa yatangije mushinga w\u2019ahatunganyirizwa nyiramugengeri mu gishanga cy\u2019akanyaru giherereye mu karere ka Gisagara.\nwamwongereye mukugaragara cyane mubizateza imbere ubukungu bwu Rwanda mubihe birimbere."}
{"id": "18578", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18578", "title": "Huye", "text": "Akarere ka.\nAkarere ka huye ni kamwe mu turere tujyize amajyepho abanyarwanda benshi bahazi ku izina butare gakora kuturere 4 arityo\nni akarere gafite ibikorwa byinshi bifitiye abaturajye akamaro kanini nka ikibuga cy'umupira wa magura mu rurimi rwa mahanga kitwa (huye stadium), kaminuza nkuru y'urwanda ndeste n'ibindi byinshi. akarere nikamwe nanone mu mijyi y'ungirije umujyi wa kigali."}
{"id": "18579", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18579", "title": "URUGANDA RUTUNGANYA UMUCERI MU AKARERE KA RWAMAGANA", "text": "Ifungwa ry'uruganda rwa rwamagana rutunganya umuceri.\nNyuma y\u2019imyaka igera muri itanu uruganda rwa Rwamagana rutunganya umuceri rufunze kubera kutumvikana kwavutse hagati y\u2019abahinzi na ba nyir\u2019uruganda, ubu rugiye kongera gufungura imiryango bitarenze Kamena uyu mwaka\nUru ruganda rutunganya umuceri mu akarere ka rwamagana rwayoborwaga n\u2019ikigo cyo muri Australia cyashoye imari mu Rwanda [Australian Investor ICM-Rwanda], rwifuzaga ko abahinzi baruzanira umuceri muremure, nyamara mu karere ka Rwamagana hasanzwe hera umuceri mugufi uzwi nka ariwo bita Kigori. uru ruganda icyo gihe ntago rwumvikanye n\u2019abahinzi b\u2019umuceri ku giciro bagombaga kubaheraho, abahinzi bo bahitamo guhagarika kugemura umusaruro wabo bituma uruganda rufunga imiryango.\nUru ruganda rwongeye gufungura imiryango.\nMu gihe ubwumvikane bwari butangiye kuza gake gake, uruganda rwiteguye kugura umuceri ku giciro abahinzi bifuzaga ku muceri mugufi, uruganda rwahise rusaba ingano y\u2019umuceri abahinzi batari kubasha kubona muri icyo gihe.\nUru ruganda rwari rwitezwe kongera gufungura imiryango umwaka ushize 2023, rwifuzaga toni ibihumbi 6 by\u2019umuceri udatonoye buri mwaka, mu gihe umusaruro wa koperative bari basanzwe bakorana muri icyo gihe wageraga hafi kuri toni ibihumbi 4 ku mwaka\nUru ruganda ubu rugiye kongera gukora nkuko rwakoraga na mbere dore ko ubu rwiyemeje kongera umusaruro"}
{"id": "18580", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18580", "title": "UMURENGE WA GAHENGERI", "text": "Gahengeri numwe mumirenge iherereye mukarere ka Rwamagana ukaba uhana imbibi nindi mirenge nka musha fumbwe niyindi \nUMUNYAMABANGA NSHINGWABIKORWA NAB'UTUGARI.\nUmunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa\nMr. BYARUHANGA John Bosco\n0783406795\nUmurenge wa Gahengeri ugizwe n'utugari ugizwe n'Utugari umunani (8) dukurikira:\nGihumuza\nUmunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa\nTwiringiyimana Siphora\n0787858206\nKagezi\nUmunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa\nKabera Raphael\n0787858207\nKanyangese\nUmunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa\nMukanoheri Henriette\n0787858208\nKibare\nUmunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa\nYankurije Capitholine\n0787858209"}
{"id": "18581", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18581", "title": "Isoko rya ntunga", "text": "Iri soko ricurizwamo ibicurizwa ibi bikurikira:imboga,imbuto,ibinyabijumba,imyambaro ndetse n'ibindi.\nIsoko rya Ntunga.\nIsoko rya Ntunga riherereye mu akarere ka Rwamagana umurenge wa Mwurire akagari ka Ntunga rikaba ari isoko rikorerwa mo ubucuruzi bw'ingeri zose harimo ibiribwa,imyambaro,ibikoresho,amatungo ndetse n'ibindi byinshi bitandukanye.\nMinisitiri w\u2019Intebe ubwo yafunguraga iri soko riri mu kagari ka Ntunga yashimiye ubuyobozi bw\u2019akarere bwaryubatse, abasaba kuricunga neza ngo hatazagira ikiryangiza kuko ryinjiriza akarere amafaranga ibihumbi 500 mu cyumweru. Yavuze ko aho yabajije ibiciro hose ubwo yaritambagiragamo yasanze ibicuruzwa bihendutse kurusha mu Mujyi wa kigali, avuga ko Abanyakigali bashobora kurihahiramo kuko ari hafi.\nNi isoko ricururizwamo ibiribwa byiganjemo ibituruka mu Karere ka Rwamagana. Rigizwe n\u2019ibagiro rya kijyambere, ahacururizwa imyambaro, ibikoresho binyuranye byo mu rugo n\u2019iby\u2019ubwubatsi; rikaba rirema ku wa mbere no ku wa kane.\nAkamaro k'iri soko rya ntunga.\nAbaturage bo muri aka karere barashimira ubuyobozi bwabatekereje ho bakabubakira iri soko rya kijyambere kuko ribafatiye runini harimo nko;gufasha abaturage kuba bakora ubucuruzi bwabo neza,gucuruza nta izuba ribageraho ndetse iri soko rinafasha abaturage kuba babasha guhaha buri kimwe bashaka batagiye kure y'iwabo.Iri soko kandi riri hafi y'umugi wa Kigali naho babasha guhahirayo ndetse nabacuruzi baho barangura yo.\nInyubako y'isoko rya Ntunga.\nInyubako y'isoko rya kijyambere rya Ntunga ryubatse mu Murenge wa Mwurire mu Karere ka Rwamagana ryuzuye ritwaye Miliyoni 333.\nMinisitiri w\u2019Intebe ubwo yafunguraga iri soko riri mu kagari ka Ntunga nkuko twabivuze yashimiye ubuyobozi bw\u2019akarere bwaryubatse, abasaba kuricunga neza ngo hatazagira ikiryangiza kuko ryinjiriza akarere amafaranga ibihumbi 500 mu cyumweru. Yavuze ko aho yabajije ibiciro hose ubwo yaritambagiragamo"}
{"id": "18582", "revid": "13863", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18582", "title": "NSABIYAREMYE Jean Claude", "text": "Amateka.\nN'umusore muto ufite mpamya bumenyi kandi w'umunyamwuga mubyo akora arazwi bihagije mu karere ka Rwamagana cyane akaba afite intego ndetse ya tangije Ishuri rifasha abana kwiga ariko byakinyamwuga."}
{"id": "18583", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18583", "title": "We for Them &amp; Music", "text": "Amateka.\nMu Murenge wa Musha mu karere ka Rwamagana.Hagara gaye abanyeshuri b'urubyiruko b'akoze itsinda ryitwa\"We For Them &amp; Music\".Bakomeje gukangurirra Urubyiruko muri rusange uko rwakwitwara kandi bagakoresha imbaraga zabo zose.\nIbikorwa.\nUrubyiruko n\u2019abayobozi ba \u2018We for Them &amp; Music\u2019 ibi nibyo bagarutseho ubwo basuraga abarwayi bo ku bitaro bya Masaka mu Karere ka Kicukiro."}
{"id": "18584", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18584", "title": "Ibitaro bikuru bya Rwamagana", "text": "Ibitaro bya Rwamagana byahawe imbangukiragutabara.\nIbitaro bikuru bya Rwamagana biherereye mu akarere ka Rwamagana imbere ya gare yaka karere bikaba bimaze gutera imbere mu ubuvuzi\nIbi bitaro bya Rwamagana mumwaka wa 2017 taliki 11 gicurasi nibwo cyahawe imbangukiragutabara eshatu kuva ubu ibi bitaro bimaze kugira ibikoresho bihagije. Dr Muhire Philbert, umuyobozi w\u2019ibitaro bikuru bya Rwamagana atangaza ko izo mbangukiragutabara zije gukemura ikibazo bahuraga nacyo cyo kugeza abarwayi ku bitaro babakuye ku bigo nderabuzima no ku yandi mavuriro aciriritse\nIbivugwa kuri bino bitaro.\nAbarwayi bajya kwivuriza ku bitaro bikuru bya Rwamagana bavuga ko bahabwa serivisi mbi ku buryo bashobora kumara nk'iminsi ibiri bataravurwa\nNi mugihe abanyamakuru b'ikinyamakuru(kigalitoday) baganiriye n'umwe mu barwayi bahasanze yaje kwivuza, avuga ko amaze iminsi ibiri aza kuhivuriza ariko atarabonana na muganga kandi arembye.\nUndi we avuga ko amaze iminsi itatu atarabona imiti kandi afite ikibazo cy\u2019umuvuduko w\u2019amaraso ukabije.\nAvuga ko gutegereza abaganga bamuha imiti igihe kirekire bituma indwara ye irushaho gukara ku buryo byamubyarira ibindi bibazo.\nIki kibazo aba barwayi bahuye nacyo bagihuriyeho n\u2019abandi barwayi batandukanye kuko bose baza kuri ibi bitaro boherejwe n\u2019ibigo nderabuzima bamwe bagataha batavuwe."}
{"id": "18585", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18585", "title": "UBUKANGURAMBAGA MUKWIPIMISHA SIDA MURUBYIRUKO", "text": "Rwamagana:Urubyiruko rwakanguriwe kwipimisha Virusi Itera SIDA kenshi gashoboka \nUbuyobozi bw'ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ubuzima RBC bwakanguriye urubyiruko rwo mu karere ka Rwamagana intara y'Iburasirazuba Umurengewa Kigabiro kwipimisha Virusi Itera SIDA kugira ngo bamenye uko bahagaze.\nUbwo ikigo gishinzwe ubuzima mu Rwanda RBC cyatangizaga ubukangurambaga bwibanda ku rubyiruko nka bamwe mu bafite ibyago byinshi byo kwandura ubwandu bushya bwa Virusi Itera SIDA bagaragaje ko imibare myinshi y'ubwandu bushya iri mu rubyiruko ndetse\u00a0 byoroshye kuribo kwibasirwa kandi aribo ejohazaza h'igihugu.\nDr Ikuzo Basile umuyobozi w'ishami rishinzwe kurwanya SIDA mu kigo cy'igihugu cy'Ubuzima RBC yavuze ko mu ngamba zafashwe mu gukumira ubwandu bushya harimo kwegera urubyiruko aho ruri hose.\nYagize Ati:\"uyu munsi muri Rwamagana twakoze ubukangurambaga ahahurira urubyiruko rwinshi,tugamije kubegera tubereka ibyiza byo kumenya uko bahagaze kugira bafate ingamba,muri raporo zakozwe twasanze mu rubyiruko ubwitabire mu kwipimisha Virusi Itera SIDA ku rubyiruko biri hasi cyane,turabegara tukabigisha.\"\nDr Basile avuga ko mu ngamba bafite harimo kugarura Club Anti-SIDA mu mashuri,kuganira na minisiteri y'urubyiruko ku buryo mu masomo bigisha hashirwamo ajyanye no Virusi Itera SIDA kugira abanyeshuri bakure baziko icyorezo kigihari bacyirinde n'ibindi.\nBamwe mu rubyiruko rutuye muri Rwamagana ruvuga ko nubwo aho kwipimishiriza hagenda hongerwa bamwe bakigira isoni zo kujyayo kubera uko bafatwa muri bagenzi babo.\nUmwe utashatse ko amazina ye atangazwa yagize ati:\"natwe dutewe impungenge n'uko urubyiruko rukomeje gushukwa n'abakuze usanga abakobwa kubera ubuzima ni gushaka kugaragara bitandukanye n'ubushobozi b'iwabo bari kwishora mu busambanyi,abasaza bakabafatirana,abenshi ntabwo bakoresha urukingirizo biradushira mu kaga.\"\nAkomeza agira Ati:\"tugiye gukangukira kwipimisha tuve mu marangamutima ubuzima nicyo gishoro dufite,tugiye kujya tunabishishikariza bagenzi bacu kwipimisha kuko umenye uko ahagaze bimufasha gufata ingamba.\"\nDr Ikuzo Basile yasabye ababyeyi guharanira gufasha abana babo kumenya uko bahagaze kuko ngo ahanini bamara igihe kinini bari kumwe n'abana kandi bakabisanzuraho kuruta undi wese.\nUbukangurambaga bwo kurwanya Virusi Itera SIDA bwatangiriye mu ntara y'Iburasirazuba kubera ko ubwandu bushya bwagaragaye ko bwiganje muri iyi ntara kuruta ibindi bice byo mu gihugu.muri rusange urubyiruko rwasobanuriwe uburyo rudakwiye gutezuka ku nshinga zo kwirinda indwara ya SIDA bityo kandi igihugu kibashe kwiteza imbere n'imibereho myiza y'abaturage yiyongere.\nAMASHAKIRO"}
{"id": "18586", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18586", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gishali", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Gishari ruherereye mu intara y'Iburasirazuba, akarere ka Rwamagana umurenge wa Gishali akagari ka Ruhimbi umudugudu wa Shaburondo rukaba rushyinguyemo imibiri 1198 y'Abatutsi bishwe muri mata 1994. Uyu Murenge kandi ubarizwamo urwibutso rwa Ruhunda rushyinguyemo imibiri 5181 y\u2019abiciwe muri ako gace.\nUhagarariye imiryango y\u2019abafite ababo bashyinguye mu rwibutso rwa Gishari, Kamasa Pierre Celestin, yavuze ko bashimira Inkotanyi kuba zarabarokoye.\nYagaragaje ko hari bimwe mu bice by\u2019urufunzo ruzengurutse ikiyaga cya Muhazi bifuza ko hakorwa umuganda wo gushakisha imibiri y\u2019abatutsi bahiciwe itari yaboneka kandi hakaba hari nimidugudu yubakiwe abacitse kw'icumu."}
{"id": "18588", "revid": "18414", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18588", "title": "Akagari ka Ruhunda", "text": "Akagari ka Ruhunda kagizwe n'imidugudu itatu ariyo: Nyagakombe, Nyagahinga na Mpungwe. Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa akaba yitwa Kaneza Alphonsine.\nAmateka.\nAka Kagari gaherereye mu murenge wa Gishari Akarere ka Rwamagana. Aka kagari niko gafite ibikorwa remezo byinshi birimo ibigo by'amashuri.\nIbikorwa.\nDuhereye ku bikorwa remezo harimo imihanda urugero: Umuhanda ugera muri Bella Flowers \nUrubyiruko.\nIbikorwa by'urubyiruko muri aka kagari."}
{"id": "18590", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18590", "title": "TURIMUMAHORO C\u00e9l\u00e9stin", "text": "Uyu musore TURIMUMAHORO C\u00e9l\u00e9stin afite kampani yibasiye imitama y'abaturage bo mu Karere ka Nyagatare aho iyo kampani iherereye kandi. Iyi kampani ye ifasha urubyiruko m'ukwiteza imbere guhanga udushya n'ibindi cyane cyane iby'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi.\nIbihembo.\nUyu mushinga wahize iyindi muri Youth connekt 2023 ahabwa miriyoni 25 frw."}
{"id": "18591", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18591", "title": "Citzen Voice And Actions", "text": "Intangiriro.\nCitzen Voice and Actions ni umuryango w'urubyiruko ugizwe n'abarenga 200 abasore n'inkumi baturutse m'uturere twose tugandagaje umujyi wa Kigali ndetse n'utwawo.\nIntego.\nintego yo kubaka ubushobozi bw\u2019urubyiruko mu bijyanye n\u2019imiyoborere."}
{"id": "18592", "revid": "13796", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18592", "title": "Uburezi kuri bose mu karere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Uburezi kuri bose mu karere ka Rwamagana.\nuburezi kuri bose ni gahunda yashizweho na leta y'uRwanga igamije gutanga uburezi kuri bose, iyo tuvuze uburezi kuri bose ni ukuvagako abana bose bagomba kwiga yaba abafite ubumuga ndetse nabatabufite.\nuburezi kuri bose nanone kandi bwumvikana nk'uburezi budaheza, aho abana bose bitabira ishuri bagafashwa hagendewe kubushobozi bwabo.\nMu karere ka Rwamagana kimwe nahandi mu Rwanda hose iyi gahunda imaze gutera imbere,gusa muri aka karere hari umwihariko wo kuba hari ishuri rifasha abana rizwi nka HVP GATAGARA.\nIbigo bitanga uburezi budaheza.\n Yanditswe na Igirimpuhwe jean d'Amour"}
{"id": "18593", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18593", "title": "Sugira Eco Resort", "text": "Amerekezo.\nIherereye Mu karere ka Rwamagana ahagana mo hagati no hagati.\nIntego.\nIntego yabo yambere n'ugufata neza umukiririya kandi umukiriya arakirwanaya yombi\nIyi Hoteri abarenze miriyoni 345 bamaze kwemezako ari hoteri uturamo hehe no kugira irungu kandi uba w'umva akayaga keza kava mukiyaga cya Muhazi. Aba kozi baho n'abanyamurava bakwitaho neza \ufffc"}
{"id": "18594", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18594", "title": "Vintage Cottage", "text": "Amerekezo.\nHoteri ya Vintage Cottage iherereye Uruhuha,mu kagari ka Gati,U murenge wa Gishali, Akarere ka Rwamagana. Kunyengero z'ikiyaga cya Muhazi. Hahora amafu nahantu buri wese yaruhukira akanahakorera ibiruhuko.\nIbikorwa.\nHari sale nini nawakoresherezamo ibirori haratuje hari imikino itandukanye ya gufasha mukuruhura mu mutwe. Hari amacumbi amara igihe gito n'ikinini kubishatse,ubusitani bwiza bwo gukiniramo,n'ibindi."}
{"id": "18596", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18596", "title": "Impano Agency", "text": "Amateka.\nImpano Agency ni itsinda rigamije gufasha urubyiruko kwiteza imbere rushingiye ku mpano ubwazo rwifitemo zitandukanye, ikanakora imishinga bihangiye ubwabo n\u2019ibikorwa byo guteza imbere igihugu.Imaze kugera kubanyamuryango 19.\nIntego.\nUko ari abanyamuryango 19 bose intego zabo n'ugufasha urubyiruko,kwihangira umurimo no guhindura sosiyete nyarwanda."}
{"id": "18597", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18597", "title": "Generation Unlimited (GenU)", "text": "Intangiriro.\nLeta y'uRwanda Kitwa \"GenU\" cy'urubyiruko n'indi miryango ifitanye umubano wahafi narwo.\nImikorere.\ngikorwa Generation Unlimited\u00a0 \u2013 cyangwa \u201cGenU\u201d \u2013 kigamije guhamya ko abagize urubyiruko bose bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 10 na 24 biga, bahugurwa cyangwa bafite umurimo cyerekezo cya 2030. GenU ifite agaciro gakomeye mu Rwanda, aho abo mu rubyiruko bafite munsi y\u2019imyaka 25 bagize 60 ku ijana by\u2019abaturage."}
{"id": "18598", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18598", "title": "Urubyiruko Mu Karere Ka Gisagara", "text": "Urubyiruko nk'imbaraga z'igihugu..\nMu Karere ka Gisagara Urubyiruko rwasuye urwibutso rwa Kigali ruri ku Gisozi n\u2019Ingoro y\u2019Urugamba rwo Guhagarika Jenoside.\nIbikorwa.\nBasuye hamwe munzibutso zikomeye bana komeza gukora inikorwa by'urukundo byo gufata mumu gongo abarokotse jenoside yakorewe abatutsi 1994."}
{"id": "18599", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18599", "title": "Urubyiruko Mu Kwiteza Imbere", "text": "Ubuhinzi.\nMu rwego rwo gushishikariza urubyiruko gukora ubuhinzi kandi mu buryo bwa kinyamwuga, umushinga Hinga Wunguke ufatanyije na Shora Neza,basinyanye amasezerano y\u2019ubufatanye agamije gufasha urubyiruko rukora ubuhinzi kwiteza imbere binyuze mu kubaha igishoro.\nIbyifuzo.\nUmukozi ushinzwe imirire myiza no kugeza abahinzi ku isoko muri Hinga Wunguke, Jeanne d\u2019Arc Nyirajyambere, avuga ko amasezerano basinyanye na Shora Neza agamije kugira ngo bongere umubare w\u2019urubyiruko ruri mu buhinzi mu bijyanye n\u2019ibihingwa bitandukanye bazakoraho hamwe no kubafasha kugeza umusaruro wabo ku isoko."}
{"id": "18600", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18600", "title": "Rwamagana Marathon Challenge", "text": "Intangiriro.\nAya ni amarushanwa yo kwiruka akaba ari imwe mumikino abaturage ba Rwamagana bakundakandi akaba ari amarushanwa ategurwa kandi akanabishyira mu bikorwa.\nAbaterankunga bayo.\nAya marushanwa akorwa kubufatanye n'umushinga MSAADA, JIBU, Ibitaro by\u2019intara bya Rwamagana, Umushinga w\u2019Ingobyi, AVEGA,\u00a0 Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ngoramubiri (RAF), Inzego z\u2019umutekano, inama y\u2019igihugu y\u2019urubyiruko (NYC), SFH, Dereva Hotel, Agrotech, Croix rouge Rwanda,\u00a0 n\u2019abandi batandukanye"}
{"id": "18601", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18601", "title": "The IPRC GISHARI", "text": "Amerekezo.\nThe IPRC Gishari iherereye mu karere ka Rwamagana, umurenge wa Gishari. Ifatanye n'ikigo cya Police Gishari Training school.\nIntego.\nIshuri Rikuru ry\u2019Imyuga n\u2019Ubumenyingiro (RP) na Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi (MINEDUC), batanze impamyabumenyi ku barangije kwiga muri za IPRCs.\nIbushobozi.\nIki kigo gifite impano nyinshi ndetse n'ubumenyi ngiro yaba ubwo bakomara kubarezi ba bo aribyo biba fungura mi mutwe bikabaha gukomeza kwagura ibitekerezo."}
{"id": "18602", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18602", "title": "NIYIBIZI Yves Cl\u00e9ment", "text": "Amateka.\nUmwana ukiri muto Niyibizi Yves usokeje kwiga muri IPRC kitabu mu Karere ka Nyamagabe, ibijyanye n\u2019amashyamba no kubyaza umusaruro ibiti hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga.\nIbikorwa.\nUyu mwana ukirimuto y'ifashishije ikoranabuhanga ndetse n'ubumenyi bwimbitse akura mwirishuri yabashije gukora umushinga w'ubiryo twakora imbaho mu bisigazwa bya parasitike n'ibarizo.\nImikorere.\nAtangazako ashaka uducupa dupfunyikwamo amavuta,utujerikani tw\u2019amavuta n\u2019amabase yashaje aba yandagaye hirya no hino, akabishongesha mu buryo butarekura imyuka ihumanya bikavangwa n\u2019ibarizo, hakavamo imbaho zikomeye."}
{"id": "18603", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18603", "title": "TWIZEYIMANA Emmanuel", "text": "Amateka.\nUmumwa w'umusore ukiri muto amazina ye TWIZEYIMANA Emmanuel nk'uko byavuzwe hejuru iyu rero akaba amaze igihe gito asoje ishama ry'jbukanoshi Muri IPRC Gishari.\nIbihembo.\nUyu musore ye gukanye igihembo cya moto itwarwa n'amashanyarazi.\nImpanuro.\nAragira urubyiruko muri rusange gukoresha imbaraga zabo zose kabagiri Inama zo gukangura Impano iyo ariyo yose ko by'ubaka kandi bikakugeza kw'itera mbere rirambye."}
{"id": "18604", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18604", "title": "UWASE Jeselyne", "text": "Amateka.\nUWASE Joselyne asoje kwiga ikiciro cya hoteri muri IPRC Musanze. Akaba ari umukobwa ukiri muto ariko wumva ko ibitekerezo bye bifite indi ntera.\nIbikorwa.\nUyu mukobwa nyuma y'uko bitabiriye Imurikabikorwa y'ihaye intego yo gukangurira (volunteerlly) Guteka indyo yuzuye ibi bikagaragazwa igipimo cy'imikurire yaho atuye ndetse n'igihugu muri rusange."}
{"id": "18605", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18605", "title": "Urubyiruko Mugukumira No Kurwanya Ibiyo Byabwenge", "text": "Icyo duhamagarirwa nk'urubyiruko..\nPolice y'uRwanda yakomeje gukangurira urubyiruko ko bakwiye kuba ijisho ryamugenzi we.\nIngamba za fashwe.\nNyumayuko basanze urubuiruko rufite uruhare rwa 55% mugukumira Ibiyobya bwenge urubyiruko rw'ifatanyije n'inzego mukubirimbura burundu."}
