{"id": "18607", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18607", "title": "PARUWASI UMWAMIKAZI W&quot;IMITSINDO", "text": "= PARUWASI UMWAMIKAZI W'IMITSINDO =\nIyi kiriziya gatorika Paruwasi Umwamikazi w'imitsindo iherereye mu karere ka Rwamagana Umurenge wa Kigabiro\nni imwe muri kiriziya zimaze igihe kirekire kuko yijihije yubire yimyaka 100 muri 2022\nIMITERERE\nkuva yashingwa imaze kugira uruhare mu iyubakwa ry'amashuri 8 mu karere ka Rwamagana\nPadiri mukuru\njean marie theophile"}
