{"id": "18685", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18685", "title": "Vakantiebeurs", "text": "Intangiriro.\nVakantiebeurs ni umushinga watangijwe n'urubyiruko mumishinga y'ubukerarugendo kubwimpamvu nyinshi zitandukanye. Uru rubyiruko rugararagaza ko ibi biteganya kongera iterambere.\nAbaterankunga.\nU Rwanda rwahagarariwe n\u2019Urwego rw\u2019Igihugu rw\u2019Iterambere, RDB; Sosiyete Nyarwanda y\u2019Ubwikorezi bwo mu Kirere, RwandAir; Wanderluxe Safaris, Blue Monkey Tours n'indi myinshi cyane."}
{"id": "18687", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18687", "title": "Mashariki African Film Festival", "text": "Mashariki African Film Festival (MAFF) ni iserukiramuco rya filime ribera i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ryerekana kandi rigahemba filime zo muri Afurika. Ryatangiye mu 2015. Riyoborwa na Tresor Senga.\nMuri iri serukiramuco herekanwa filime, hatangwa amahugurwa kandi haba ibiganiro. Mu 2025, iserukiramuco ryabaye ku nshuro ya 11.\nAmateka.\nIserukiramuco rya mbere ryabaye kuva ku ya 8 kugeza ku ya 14 Werurwe 2015, i Kigali. Igihembo cya filime nziza cyahawe \"Virgem Margarida\" ya Lic\u00ednio Azevedo, wo muri Mozambike.\nIserukiramuco rya gatatu ryabaye kuva ku ya 25 kugeza ku ya 31 Werurwe 2017. Ryabereye muri Kigali Conference and Exhibition Village. Insanganyamatsiko yaryo yari \u00abMy Story, My Passion, My Journey\u00bb. Floriane Kaneza ni we wari umuyobozi waryo. Abakora filime barindwi bo mu Rwanda no muri Afurika bahawe ibihembo.\nMuri Werurwe 2020, iserukiramuco ryarasubitswe. Byari biteganyijwe ko rigaruka muri Kanama 2021.\nKu ya 25 Ugushyingo 2023, iserukiramuco rya cyenda ryatangijwe muri Kigali Conference and Exhibition Village. Ryafunguwe na Sandrine Umutoni, Umunyamabanga wa Leta muri Minisiteri y'Urubyiruko. Abategura iserukiramuco bakiriye filime zigera ku 2 300. Bahisemo filime 72, mu byiciro bya filime ndende, filime ngufi na filime mbarankuru. Muri iri serukiramuco herekanywe filime, hatangwa amahugurwa kandi haba ibiganiro. Ryajyanye n'imurikagurisha rya sinema ryitwa \u00abMasharket\u00bb.\nIserukiramuco rya 11 ryabaye kuva ku ya 22 kugeza ku ya 29 Ugushyingo 2025. Abahagarariye Netflix na Amazon Prime bari bitezwe muri iri serukiramuco. Igihembo cya filime mbarankuru nziza cyahawe \"Memories of Love Returned\" ya Ntare Guma Mbaho Mwine. Muri uwo mwaka, ibihembo by'umukinnyi mwiza w'umugabo n'umukinnyi mwiza w'umugore byatanzwe bwa mbere."}
{"id": "18689", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18689", "title": "Umubyeyi n'umwana", "text": "Umubyeyi n'umwana.\nUmubyeyi n'izina rusange rikoreshwa k'umuntu umaze kugira umugisha wo kubona urubyaro. umubyeyi ashobora kuba umugabo cg umugore kuko umwana agira ababyeyi babiri papa na mama. umwana kuva umunsi wa mbere w'iremwa rye aba mu nda ya mama we amezi icyenda yashira akavuka. Urujyendo rw'umwana na babyeyi be bombi ruba rutangiye agahabwa uburere, umico ikiruta ibindi bakamuha urukundo."}
{"id": "18691", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18691", "title": "Rwamagana rice", "text": "= RWAMAGANA RICE =\nRwamagana rice uru ni uruganda rutunganya umuceri maze rukawu geza ku soko.\nIMITERERE\nUru ruganda rwubatswe mu mwaka w'2000 rwubakwa mu ntara y'iburasirazub akarere ka rwamagana umurenge wa kigabiro. Umuyobozi warwo ni ICM.\nRwafungiwe imiryano muri 2019 kubera ibibazo rwari rwaragiranye nareta ndetse na abahinzi bahinga umuceri mukarere ka Rwamagana."}
{"id": "18692", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18692", "title": "N generuos kigoma", "text": "N generous kigoma ni umuhanzi w'indirimbo zisanzwe wavukiye mu karere ka gisagara mu ntara y'amajyepfo y' U Rwanda akaba ubu abarizwa mu ntara y'iburasirazuba mu karere ka rwamagana mu murenge wa gishari, ariko ubu akaba ari mu mujyi wa kigari kubera impamvu z'akazi. mu ndirimbo Generous yahanze harimo izitwa nka\" Kunda umurimo, ngarukira, isezerano... uwo muhanzi yitwa N generous kigoma nk'izina ry'ubuhanzi ariko amazina ye bwite ni NDAYISHMIYE olivier."}
{"id": "18739", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18739", "title": "Philippe MWIZERWA", "text": "Amateka.\nUyu musore Philippe Mwizerwa atuye mu karere ka Gatsibo mu ntara y'iburasira zuba.\nIbikorwa.\navuga ko kwitabira ibiganiro bihuza urubyiruko bibafasha guhura bagasobanurirwa byinshi kuri gahunda za Leta no kumenya aho bashobora kuba bazamurana.\numukoro.\nN'umukozi akora ibikorwa bye kandi akiteza imbere ari fashije urebye ameze neza."}
{"id": "18749", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18749", "title": "Wikimedia Foundation", "text": "The Wikimedia Foundation, Inc, mu magambo ahinnye ya WMF, ni umuryango w'Abanyamerika 501 (c) (3) udaharanira inyungu ufite icyicaro gikuru i San Francisco, muri Kaliforuniya, kandi wanditswemo nk'ishingiro ry'abagiraneza. Nicyicaro cya Wikipedia, urubuga rwa karindwi rusurwa cyane kwisi. Mubyongeyeho, fondasiyo yakira indi mishinga 14 ijyanye nayo. Ifasha iterambere rya MediaWiki, software ya wiki ibashigikira byose. "}
{"id": "18751", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18751", "title": "Ingoro y'abami mu rukari", "text": "Ingoro y\u2019Abami iherereye mu Karere ka Nyanza mu murenge wa Busasamana mu ntara ya Majyepfo\u00a0 kuri kirometero 5 uvuye mu mugi wa Nyanza. Ingoro y\u2019Umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa itanga ishusho isesenguye y\u2019imiterere y\u2019ubutegetsi bwa cyami. Ingoro y'amateka y'ibwami Inyanza mu Rukari."}
{"id": "18752", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18752", "title": "Umurenge wa Mutenderi", "text": "Umurenge wa Mutenderi ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Mutenderi wari utuwe n'abaturage 24 915.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Mutenderi ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Ngoma. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 75,57. Umurenge wa Mutenderi wose ni icyaro.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mutenderi wari utuwe n'abaturage 20 907. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 24 915. Muri bo, abagabo bari 11 870, abagore bari 13 045."}
{"id": "18753", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18753", "title": "Ecole secondaire du saint esprit de nyanza", "text": "Ecole secondaire du Saint Esprit de Nyanza ni rimwe mu mashuri yisumbuye ari mu murenge wa Busasamana mu Karere ka Nyanza ryatangiye mu mwaka wa 1964. Ni ishuri Gatorika rifatanya na leta y'u Rwanda rikaba riherereye hafi ya kiliziya Christ Roi.\nAmateka.\nIshuri ryisumbuye ryitiriwe Roho Mutagatifu rya Nyanza ryatangiye mu mwaka w'amashuri 1963-1964 ritangijwe na Padiri Theophile Horsten. Icyo gihe ritangira ryitwaga Ecole des Moniteurs Auxiliares. Nyuma yaho gato ryahinduriwe izina ryitwa Ecole normale inferieure aha rikaba ryarigishaga ibijyane no gutegura abazaba abarimu mu mashuri abanza.\nMu 1979 nabwo ryaje guhindurirwa izina ryitwa Ecole Normale inferieure Stella Matutina Kugeza mu 1982 ubwo ryafataga izina rya Normale primaire kugeza 1990 iri shuri ryakiaga abanyeshuri b'abahungu gusa,muri uwo mwaka niho ryatangiye kwakira ibitsina byombi abahungu n'abakobwa nyuma rihindurirwa izina ryitwa Ecole normale du Saint Esprit. \nMu mwaka wa 1998 ishami ry'inderabarezi ryakuweho muri iki kigo hazanwa andi mashami atandukanye nk'icungamari n'ubucuruzi, amategeko n'ubutegetsi,imibare. ibidukikije n'ubugeni hakaba n'ikiciro rusange ni nabwo ryahinduye izina ryitwa Ecole Secondaire du Saint Esprit. \nImikorere Yaryo.\nIri shuri kuri ubu ryakira abahungu n'abakobwa bo mucyiciro rusange ndetse no kiciro kisumuyeho mu mashami y'imibare,ibidukikije,ubugenge.. kuburyo abanyeshuri baharangiriza buri mwaka bajya muri Kaminuza mu gihungu no hanze yacyo.\nAmashakiro "}
{"id": "18754", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18754", "title": "Akagali ka Rwesero", "text": "Akagali ka Rwesero ni kamwe mu tugari duherereye mu Rwanda tugize umurenge wa Busasamana mu karere ka Nyanza, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Ako kagari niho dusanga ibiro by'Akarere ka Nyanza, ndetse n'Ingoro y'Umwami Rudahigwa iri ahitwa mu Rukari muri ako kagali. \nImiterere n'Abaturage.\nUkurikije ibarura rusange ry'abaturage n'imiturire ryo mu Rwanda, Akagali ka Rwesero gatuwe n'abaturage ibihumbi banyuranye batuye mu midugudu igize aka kagali. Imidugudu izwi cyane irimo:\nAmateka n'Ubukerarugendo.\nAkagali ka Rwesero kazwi cyane mu mateka y'u Rwanda y'mwami n'uburezi bw'umuco. Ni kamwe mu bice bisurwa cyane n'abakerarugendo mu Rwanda kubera ibi bikorwa bikurikira:\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu Mudugudu wa Murambi mu Kagali ka Rwesero, niho hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyanza. Iru rwbubutso rurimo amateka akomeye y'Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku musozi wa Muyira n'ahandi mu cyahoze ari Butare n'i Gitarama, bishwe mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994. Rukoreshwa mu rwego rwo kwibuka no kwiga amateka kugira ngo Jenoside itazongera kubaho ukundi.\nIbikorwaremezo n'Ubuvuzi.\naka kagali kari mu mujyi wa Nyanza, gafite ibikorwaremezo bihagije birimo:"}
{"id": "18755", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18755", "title": "Ibiyaga n'imigezi yo mu Rwanda", "text": "Ibiyaga n'imigezi yo mu Rwanda ni bimwe mubidukije bifitiye akamaro abaturage na leta muri rusange. mu gihugu cyacu cy'u Rwanda tuhasanga ibiyaga nkurugero: icyiyaga cya Kivu, Muhazi, Ruhondo, Burera, sake nibindi byinshi kandi tuhasanga n'imigezi nka Nyabarongo, Mwogo, Mbirurume, Akanyaru ndetse nindi migezi nyinshi. ikigo gishinzwe ibidukije gikangurira abaturage kubungabunga ibiyaga n'imigezi dushyira ibikorwa remezo byibuze aharenga metero mirongo itanu(50m) uvuye ku nkombe zikiyaga cyangwa imigezi. Inkengero z\u2019ibiyaga n\u2019imigezi iyo zitabungabunzwe neza, bigira ingaruka nyinshi zirimo ihumana ry\u2019amazi y\u2019ibiyaga n\u2019imigezi biturutse ku bikorwa bya muntu bikorerwa mu nkengero za yo, ndetse no kwangirika k\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima (inyamaswa n\u2019ibimera) biba mu mazi y\u2019ibiyaga n\u2019imigezi no ku nkombe za byo."}
{"id": "18759", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18759", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu amavubi", "text": "= AMAVUBI =\niyi kipe yi igihugu amavubi yavutse mumwaka w'1964 icyo gihe abayobozi b'umupira wamaguru mu rwanda bakoranyije abari abakinnyi b'imena mu rwanda babakoranyiriza mu ruhengeri babakoramo amakipe abiri barakina bahatangiriza ikipe y'igihugu utyo.\nIZINA AMAVUBI\nirizina ryibarutswe mu mwaka w'1974 ubwo abayobozi ba minisiteri ya sport n'urubyiruko bakoreshaga igisa nki irushanwa ryo kwita izina \nikipe y'igihugu icyo gihe izina ryahize ayandi ni amavubi. ubusanzwe amavubi ni udusimba tugira amahane cyane kuko tudwingana"}
