{"id": "18806", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18806", "title": "Ivubiro", "text": "Ivubiro ni ahantu habaga hari ikibindi kinini mu muco nyarwanda kigafasha kureba igihe imvura izagwira bakabibwirwa nuko icyo kibindi kinini cyabaga gitangiye kuzana icyuya bakabonako imvura yenda kugwa. Ivubiro ryakorwagaho nabantu bitwa Abavumbyi. Ahitwa mu Mariba ya Bukunzi ni ho hari ivubiro rya Ndagano wategekaga u Bukunzi ku mwaduko w\u2019abazungu. Bukunzi yari iherereye mu Majyepfo y\u2019Uburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda, ihana imbibi n\u2019uturere tw\u2019u Busozo, i Cyesha, Impara, na Biru ndetse n\u2019igihugu cy\u2019u Burundi.\nAmateka.\nIvubiro rero ryabaga rikoze mu kibindi gifite umurwa ureba hejuru, hakaba hari amazi amanuka akagwa muri ako kabindi gatabye mu butaka, kari ahazwi nka Huro, umusozi wa Huro, Akagari ka Huro umurenge wa Muhondo, akarere ka Gakenke.aho kaba gakikijwe n'ibiti bitandukanye byagakondo nk'umubirizi cyangwa umuravumba."}
{"id": "18807", "revid": "16886", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18807", "title": "Abavubyi", "text": "Abavubyi ni abantu babaga bakuze munyaka bakaba bari bashizwe kubwira Umwami uko ibihe ziba mimeze nki imvura izagwa vuba cyangwa se amapfa azatera hakava uruzuba rwinshi, maze inzara igatera, aho bakorera hitwaga Ivubiro.\nAmateka.\nIvubiro rya mbere ryari i Musana kwa Musengo, i Kabona ka murambo, hakaba ari mu murenge wa Ruhondo muri Gakenke, ryamezeho ikiti cy'umwifuzo. Irindi riri i Uro. naho irya 3 riri i kuri Nyabarongo ryamezeho igiti cy'umukindo."}
{"id": "18808", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18808", "title": "Inteko y'Umuco mu Rwanda", "text": "Inteko y'Umuco ni kimwe mu bigo bya Leta mu Rwanda cyashyizweho n'Iteka rya Perezida nomero 082/01 ryo ku wa 28/08/2020 kugira ngo kibungabunge umurage w\u2019Igihugu kandi kirinde ururimi rw\u2019Ikinyarwanda, umuco n\u2019indangangaciro zawo nk\u2019umusingi w\u2019ubumwe n\u2019agaciro by\u2019Abanyawanda.\nInshingano.\nKuva Inteko y'Umuco yashyirwaho mu mwaka wa 2020 yahawe inshingano cumi n'icyenda (19) zikubiye mu nkingi eshanu (5) ari na zo zinyuzwamo ibikorwa bijyanye no kubungabunga umurage ndangamuco, kurengera ururimi rw'Ikinyarwanda, guteza imbere umuco n'indangagaciro, serivisi z'Inkoranyabitabo n'Ishinguranyandiko ndetse no guteza imbere inganda ndangamuco. \nN'ubwo mu ntango Inteko y'Umuco yari ifite izi nshingano zose, ijyanye no guteza imbere ubuhanzi yaje kwimurirwa muri Minisiteri y'Urubyiruko yitwa Minisiteri y\u2019Urubyiruko n\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Ubuhanzi nyuma y'icyemezo cyatangajwe na Guverinoma y'u Rwanda ku wa 14 Ukuboza 2023, bikanasohoka mu Igazeti ya Leta n\u00b0 20 Bis yo ku wa 13/05/2024. \nAmateka.\nInteko y'Umuco yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2020 ihurizwamo ibigo bitatu (3): Ikigo cy'Ingoro z'Igihugu z'Umurage w'u Rwanda, Inteko Nyarwanda y\u2019Ururimi n\u2019Umuco ndetse n'Ikigo cy'Igihugu gishizwe Serivisi z'Ishyinguranyandiko n'Inkoranyabitabo. \nKuva mu 2020, Inteko y'Umuco yabaye Ikigo gishamikiye kuri Minisiteri y'Urubyiruko n'Umuco. Mu 2023, inshingano z'umuco zimuriwe muri Minisiteri y'Ubumwe bw'abanyarwanda n'inshingano mboneragihugu, MINUBUMWE mu mpine, maze Inteko y'Umuco na yo ihita iba Ikigo gishamikiye kuri iyo Minisiteri. \nAmashami.\nIgishingwa, Inteko y'Umuco yari ifite amashami atanu (5): Ishami rishinzwe Kubungabunga Ururimi n'Umuco, Ishami rishinzwe Imicungire y'Ingoro z'umurage 8 n'ahantu ndangamurage cyangwa ndangamateka, Ishami rishinzwe Serivisi z'Ishyinguranyandiko ry'Igihugu, Ishami rishinzwe Serivisi z'Inkoranyabitabo y'Igihugu ndetse n'Ishami rishinzwe guteza imbere inganda ndangamuco. \nNyuma yo kwimurira inshingano z'ubuhanzi muri Minisiteri y'urubyiruko mu mwaka wa 2023, ishami rishinzwe inganda ngangamuco ryahise ryimurirwa muri iyo Minisiteri. Bivuze ko guhera muri uwo mwaka, ubu Inteko y'Umuco ifite amashami ane (4). \nUbuyobozi.\nNyuma yo gushingwa, Inteko y'Umuco yahawe inzego eshatu zifite inshingano zitandukanye: Inama y\u2019Ubuyobozi, Inama Nkuru y\u2019Ururimi n\u2019Umuco (igizwe n\u2019abantu cumi na batanu (15) bitwa Intiti bagira manda y\u2019imyaka itanu (5) ishobora kongerwa inshuro imwe) ndetse n'Urwego Nshingwabikorwa (rugizwe n\u2019Intebe y\u2019Inteko, rushobora kandi kugira n\u2019Intebe y\u2019Inteko Yungirije).\nKuva mu 2020, Inteko y'Umuco iyoborwa n'Intebe y'Inteko (Umuyobozi mukuru) Ambasaderi MASOZERA MUTANGUHA Robert. Intebe y'Inteko yungirije (Umuyobozi mukuru wungirije) wa mbere kuva Ikigo cyashingwa ni ushinzwe Kubungabunga no Guteza imbere Ururimi n'Umuco ni Bwana UWIRINGIYIMANA Jean-Claude. \nIsoko y\u2019ibiri muri iyi nyandiko.\n1. Iteka rya Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe no 017/03 ryo ku wa 10/05/2024 rigena intego, inshingano n\u2019imbonerahamwe y\u2019imyanya y\u2019imirimo bya Minisiteri y\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda n\u2019Inshingano Mboneragihugu,\n2. Iteka rya Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe no 018/03 ryo ku wa 10/05/2024 rigena intego, inshingano n\u2019imbonerahamwe y\u2019imyanya y\u2019imirimo bya Minisiteri y\u2019Urubyiruko n\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Ubuhanzi. \n3. Umwaka wa 59, Igazeti ya Leta n\u00b0 Idasanzwe yo ku wa 04/09/2020, Itegeko N\u00b0 011/2020 ryo ku wa 28/08/2020 rikuraho Inteko Nyarwanda y\u2019Ururimi n\u2019Umuco / Iteka rya Perezida N\u00b0 082/01 ryo ku wa 28/08/2020 rishyiraho Inteko y\u2019Umuco, byarebwe ku wa 29 Kamena 2024"}
{"id": "18810", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18810", "title": "Land mangment in Rwanda", "text": "Importance of land registration in Rwanda.\nLand registration in Rwanda is crucial as it provides clear proof of ownership, reducing disputes and enhancing legal protection. It enables landowners to use their property as collateral for loans, promoting economic growth. Additionally, it improves tax collection efficiency, supports effective land use planning, and fosters social stability by clearly defining ownership and boundaries, all of which contribute to Rwanda's overall development and stability."}
