{"id": "19320", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19320", "title": "Umujyi wa Nyamata", "text": "Umujyi wa Nyamata ni umujyi uherereye mu karere ka bugesera mu intara y'iburasirazuaba bwu Rwanda kandi ufite inyubako inyubako ndende zidasanzwe ziwugize zitari iz\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo gusa, ahubwo ari iza Leta; harimo nk\u2019inyubako ya Banki ya baturage, ishami ry\u2019Iburasirazuba, iya MTN Rwanda ndetse n\u2019inyubako izitanduksnye harimo ibiro by\u2019Intara y\u2019Iburasirazuba n\u2019Akarere ka Bugesera ndetse n'abaturage bahatuye, ni umujyi ugaragaza umuvuduko w\u2019iterambere nk\u2019uwo wahoranye mu bihe byashize.\nNyamata.\nUmujyi wa Nyamata ni umwe mu mijyi ufite icyerekezo bijyanye n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imujyi wa mu Rwanda hari ibikivugwa nk\u2019ibyiterambere, aha havugwamo isoko rya Nymata, amahoteli n\u2019amaresitora, amaguriro rusange manini azwi nka mall."}
{"id": "19321", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19321", "title": "Ishuri rya Nelson Mandera TVET School", "text": "Ishuri rya Nelson Mandera TVET School ni ishuri ry'isumbuye ribarizwa mu mashuri ari ari tekinike miu Rwanda, riri ryo mu Murenge wa Ntarama.\nserivisi.\nIshuri rya Nelson Mandera TVET School riherereye mu urenge wa Ntarama mu karere ka bugesera mu inta y'iburasirazuba bwu Rwanda, hari amasomo yu bwubatsi, amashanyarazi nibindi."}
{"id": "19322", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19322", "title": "GS. Kamabuye", "text": "GS. Kamabuye ni ishuri ryitwa goupe scolaire Kamabuye, ni ishuri ry'isumbuye ribarizwa mu mashuri ari ya leta miu Rwanda, riri ryo mu Murenge wa Ntarama aho rigenzurwa na Mineduc binyuze muri Reb.\nSerivisi.\nGS. Kamabuye ni ikigo cya leta gitanga amasomo agiye atandukanye byose bishingiye ku ireme ry'uburezi mu Rwanda, hakaba hari icyiciro rusange mu mashuri y'isumbuye, ndetse n'ibindi masomo y'ashuri y'isumbuye. iri shuri ribarizwa mu karere ka BUgesera. "}
{"id": "19323", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19323", "title": "GS. Dihiro", "text": "GS. Dihiro ni (ishuri ryitwa goupe scolaire Dihiro) ni ishuri ry'isumbuye ribarizwa mu mashuri agenzurwa ya leta mu ifasi yu Rwanda, riri mu Murenge wa Gashora, aho rigenzurwa na Mineduc binyuze muri Reb.\nSerivisi.\nGS. Dihiro ni ikigo cya leta gitanga amasomo agiye atandukanye byose bishingiye ku ireme ry'uburezi mu Rwanda, hakaba hari icyiciro rusange mu mashuri y'isumbuye, ndetse n'ibindi masomo y'ashuri y'isumbuye. iri shuri ribarizwa mu karere ka BUgesera."}
{"id": "19324", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19324", "title": "Ikigo cya Espoir de l\u2019avenir", "text": "WHAT TO KNOW ABOUT ESPOIR DE L'AVENIR SCHOOL \nEcole Espoir de l\u2019Avenir cyangwa se ikigo cya Espoir\u00a0ni ikigo cy\u2019amashuri giherereye mu intara y\u2019iburasirazuba bwu Rwanda, Akarere ka Bugesera mu murenge wa Nyamata, Munsi ya gare ya Nyamata. Iki kigo gifite amashuri y'incuke Nursery 1-3 biga muri sisiteme y'Igifaransa. Kikagira n'amashuri abanza P1-P6 biga muri sisiteme y'Icyongereza. Iki kigo kirazwi cyane mu Rwanda no mu bindi bihugu, kikaba cyaramamaye kubera gutsindisha neza mu bizamini bya leta mu mashuri abanza.\nIgihe cyose utwaye umwana kuri iri shuri baramwakira Kandi bakamushyira muri sisiteme ituma azatsinda ikizamini cya Leta. Abanza baho bigishwa gukora cyane no kwiga amasomo yose uhereye ku mibare.\nAkarusho k'iri shuri rifite imodoka zifasha muri Transport aho ritwara abanyeshuri kuva muri GAHANGA ya Kicukiro, Ntarama, Kanzenze, Carriers, Arrete, Lapalise, Maranyundo, Gahembe, MAYANGE, na Riziyeri.\nUshobora gusura iri shuri I NYAMATA aho rikorera cyangwa ugakurikirana ibikorwa byazo kuri izi mbuga nkoranyambaga.\nWhatsap \nUgutsinda kwa espoir de l'avenir.\nIkigo cya espoir ahari muri mwaka wa 2017 kandi iki kigo cyagize umwana wabaye uwa\u00a0 4 mu gihugu witwa Muhire Igor, muri 2018 Espoir de l\u2019Avenir yagize umwana wabaye uwa 3 yitwa kagoyire, naho 2019 iki kigo cyagize umwana wabaye uwa \u00a04 mu gihugu witwa Rubayiza no mu yindi myaka yakurikiyeho kagiye kigira abanyeshuri ba mbere mu gihugu nk'uwitwa KAZUBWENGE VANESSA..."}
{"id": "19325", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19325", "title": "KTN Rwanda", "text": "KTN Rwanda ni isosiyete ikorera mu Rwanda byumwihariko mu karere ka Bugesera mu intara y'iburasirazuba bwu Rwanda, ni kampani yashinzwe n'umugabo witwa akaba ari Rwiyemezamirimo ndetse arinawe uyibobora Hagenimana Philemon ariwe washinze Kampani\u00a0 ya KTN Rwanda igura ikanagurisha ibibanza.\nServisi.\nKTN Rwanda ikorera mu intara y'iburasirazuba bwu Rwanda mu turerre dutandukanye harimo bugesera mu mirenge ingiye itandukanye hari Juru, Umureenge wa Mayange, Umurenge wa Mwogo."}
{"id": "19326", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19326", "title": "Paruwase ya Rilima", "text": "Paruwase ya Rilima ni Paruwasi yo muri kiriziya Gatolika muri Diyoseze ya Kigali, Paruwasi ya Rilima ikaba yari imaze imyaka igera kuri mirongo 40 idafite umusaseridoti uhavuka ariko ubu bakaba bahari bagera kuri 2. Paruwase ya Rilima iri mu karere ka Bugesera."}
{"id": "19327", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19327", "title": "Yubile y'imyaka 50 i Bugesera", "text": "Yubile y'imyaka 50 i Bugesera yatangiye ku itariki ya 04\u00a0 Werurwe 1973, mu karere ka Bugesera nibwo Paruwasi ya Rilima y'ijihije iyi yubile aho tangiye igizwe n\u2019ibihuru n\u2019amashyamba ubwo yavukaga,aho abayisengeragamo bari biganjemo impunzi z\u2019Abarundi zari zarahahungiye, aho bakaba barasengeraga\u00a0 munsi y\u2019igiti cy\u2019Umujwiri.\nKera.\nYubile y'imyaka 50 i Bugesera ni umuhango wayobowe na Nyiricyubahiro Antoine Cardinal Kambanda, uyu munsi Rilima ikaba ituwe n\u2019abantu benshi batuye heza mu iterambere rishimwa na bose, aha ni ahantu hahoze ari ishyamba ry\u2019inzitane rigizwe n\u2019amoko y\u2019ibiti atandukanye, Riulima ishamikiyeho Santarari ya Nyabagendwa."}
{"id": "19328", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19328", "title": "G.S ya Rilima", "text": "G.S ya Rilima bivuze Groupe scolaire de Rilima, ni ikigo cya shinzwe kuva ryashingwa muri 1973, ni ikigo giherere mu murenge wa Rilima mu karere ka Bugesera mu intara y'iburasirazuba bwu Rwanda. \nserivisi.\nG.S ya Rilima ni ikigo cyizeho abahanzi cyangwa se abantu bagiye batandukanye banzi nk'Umuhanzi w\u2019umunyarwenya Garasiyani Niyitegeka uzwi nka Papa Sava, Sekaganda na Seburikoko ndetse harimo n'umugabo nka Gasore Serge \".\""}
{"id": "19329", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19329", "title": "Abuzukuru ba Rwerekana", "text": "Abuzukuru ba Rwerekana ni abuzukuru bavuka kumuhungu we mu gisirikari cya RDF cyu Rwanda, wari umwana w\u2019Umucuruzi witwaga Rwerekana, aha akaba yarazize wazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 2024 umuhugnu we yashakanye na Uwamahoro JMV.bari batuye mu karere ka Bugesera mu intara y'iburasirazuba bwu RWand\"a\" \".\" "}
{"id": "19330", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19330", "title": "Imihanda y'icyaro muri Bugesera", "text": "Mu karere ka Bugesera mu intara y'iburasirazuba bwu Rwanda, hari imishinga yo gutunganya imihanda itandukanye y\u2019icyaro imaze igatanga urubyiruko kwiteza imbere.\nImishinga.\nHari imishinga wa Leta ugamije gufasha urubyiruko ruri munsi y'imyaka 30, kwihangira imirimo, aho ibigo bigera kuri 600 kompani by\u2019urubyiruko byatanze uburyo byakoresha iyo nkunga maze ibigo 154 biba aribyo byemererwa mu gihugu hose, bakaba bari mu bikorwa byo gutunganya imihanda mu turere dutandukanye urugero muri ibyo bigo bivugwa akaba ari AGECOS ikorera mu murenge wa Rweru."}
{"id": "19331", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19331", "title": "Ibirwa bya Mazane", "text": "Ibirwa bya Mazane ni ibirwa biri mu mudugugu bemerewe na nyakubahwa Perezida wa Repubulika yu Rwanda, Paul Kagame mu karere ka Bugesera mu intara y'iburasirazuba bwu Rwanda.\nUmudugudu.\nUmudugudu wa Mbuganzeri, aba bahanzi bavuga ko wiganjemo \u00a0impano nyinshi ziri mu rubyiruko ruhabarizwa, ku buryo benshi ngo bifashishwa mu birori n\u2019iminsi mikuru itandukanye kuva mu mududugudu kugeza no ku urwego rw\u2019igihugu, \u00a0bakaba \u00a0bibanda ku nyigisho \u00a0zikangurira abanyarwanda kubana mu mahoro, kurinda urubyiruko ibiyobyabwenge, ubwomanzi, uburaya n\u2019izindi ngeso mbi zitesha agaciro umunyarwanda."}
{"id": "19332", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19332", "title": "Uko wategura umushinga.", "text": "ubuyobozi bw'umushinga..\nUmushinga: ni umugambi wumuntu kugiti cye cyangwa afatanyije nabandi wateguwe neza kugirango ugere kuntego runaka. \nubuyobozi:n'igikorwa cyokuyobora itsinda ry'abantu cyangwa umuryango. \nubuyobozi bwumushinga:nigikorwa cyo kuyobora umushinga binyuze mugukoresha neza ubumenyi, ubumenyi ngiro, ubumenyere, ibikoresho, n'ubumenyere mubikorwa by'umushinga kugirango ugere kuntego zawo. \n\"ibice by'ingenzi bigize umushinga.\".\n1.gutangira umushinga \n2.gutegura umushinga\n3.gushyira mubikorwa \n4.gukurikirana no kugenzura umushinga\n5.gusoza umushinga "}
{"id": "19333", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19333", "title": "Isoko rya Mwulire", "text": "Isoko riherereye mukarere ka Rwamagana umurenge wa Mwurile mukagari ka Ntunga Hashize umwaka rifunguwe ryatashywe kumugaragaro kuwa 23 kamena 2023, kubufatanye na visi mayor Karangwa Umutoni, Iri soko ririmo ibicuruzwa bitandukanye haba ibituruka mubuhinzi n'ibituruka mubworozi.\nAndi makuru wamenya kwisoko rya mwulire.\nBetter World Rwanda ni umushinga utegamiye kuri Leta ufasha abagore bacitse kw'icumu kwiteza imbere bakava mubwigunge kubufatanye na COICA bishyize hamwe bategura umushinga witwa Ultra Poor Graduation Project for Women Headed Household\u2019s wogukomeza gufasha abo bagore bacitse kwicumu kwiteza imbere ndetse nokuva mubwigunge. Bakoze itsinda baryita KORA-WIGIRE. Iryo tsinda KORA-WIGIRE ribafasha kwigirira icyizere,rikabigisha kuzigama,kwiga guhinga neza,rikabaha n'amatungo,gukodesherezwa imirima ndetse nokubona inyongera musaruro. Kubufatanye n'ubuyobozi bwa Rwamagana babashyiriyeho isoko rya Mwulire kuko bari bamaze kwihaza mubiribwa bageze kurwego rwogusagurira amasoko.\nUmuhuzabikorwa w'umushinga KORA-WIGIRE muri Better World Rwanda, Antoine Kimenyi avugako ababyeyi 287 (81 bo mu murenge wa Munyiginya na 206 bo mu Murenge wa Mwulire) bari abakene bo mu cyiciro cya mbere n'icya akabiri by'ubudehe ariko ubu ngo bashoboye kwikura mubukene bukabije, binyuze mugukomeza korora, guhinga neza no kwizigamira. \nKimenyi akomeza agira ati \"Muri ikigihe cyose tumaranye kuva mu kwezi kwa werurwe 2021, bashoboye kwizigamira amafaranga y'u Rwanda angana na miliyoni 27, aho buri mwaka bahura bakagabana amafaranga bizigamye hamwe n'inyungu.\""}
