{"id": "19341", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19341", "title": "Mike kayihura", "text": "Umwuga akora.\nMike Kayihura ni umuhanzi ufite imyaka 25 y'amavuko akaba ari umwanditsi w'indirimbo zinyuranye ziganjemo niza hip hop. Ndetse akaba akunda imiziki y'uwitwa Stevie Wonder, yatangiye kuririmba afite imyaka 13 y'amavuko muri korari ya Gikirisitu mu mujyi wa Kigali. Kayihura yize umuziki muri Etiyopiya ni naho yatorejwe kuririmba no kwandika indirimbo. Indirimbo ya mbere yasohoye yitwa Let your worries go, igaragaza Benny Black mu w'ibihumbi bibiri na makumyabiri na kane(2024)yakurikiwe n'izindi ndirimbo icyenda arizo tina yo muri 2014, towards everlasting yo muri 2014, temptatin yo muri 2015, burimunsi yo muri 2015, ndugu Kalisa yo muri 2015, maria in la,mama and the city muri 2016, nina with the side eye muri 2018, religion 2018, over the sun muri 2018 ndetse n'izindi alubumu agenda asohora uko ibihe bihita.\nIbimutera imbaraga mu gukora ibihangano.\nMike yemera ko nk'umuhanzi afite uruhare runini mu gufasha urubyiruko kugenda ku murongo mwiza wo kuba abo n'ubundi bashoboye kuba bo. Mu ndirimbo ye \" temeptation\" yavuze ko yashakaga kwibutsa abantu kureba no gukangukira aho baba bari, n'ababari uruhande kuko ari mu bintu bikomeye bikugira uwo uri we, kandi akaba anifuza kuzashinga korari y'abana kuko biri mu bintu bya mbere byatumye abasha kuzamura impano ye kuva ku myaka micye cyane."}
{"id": "19342", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19342", "title": "Rwanda Film Office", "text": "Rwanda Film Office cyatangiye muri 2019 ni ibiro by\u2019amafirime mu Rwanda akaba ari ikigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda muri guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda ishinzwe guteza imbere inganda zikoresha amajwi n'amashusho cyangwa filime. "}
{"id": "19343", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19343", "title": "Jet lee", "text": "Jet Li yavukiye Li Lian Jie i Beyijing, mu Bushinwa. Yatangiye imyitozo mu ishuri rya Beyijing wushu \"(wushu ni siporo y\u2019igihugu cy\u2019Ubushinwa, ahanini ni uburyo bwo kwerekana uburyo butandukanye bwo kurwana)\" afite imyaka umunani. Yatsindiye imidari itanu ya zahabu muri shampiyona y'Ubushinwa, iyambere yayitsindiye afite imyaka 11 gusa.\nFilimi.\nMu myaka ye y'ubugimbi, yari asanzwe ari umutoza w\u2019igihugu, kandi mbere y\u2019imyaka 20 yari yarakinnye muri filime ye ya mbere,yiswe: The Shaolin Temple (1982), iyo yatangiye kungu-fu bumu mugihugu cy'Ubushinwa. Yimukiye muri Hong Kong, aho yari inyenyeri nini yo mu ntangiriro za kung-fu ya za 90. ubushobozi bwe bwambere bwavutse mu kwirwanaho kwo mumwaka wa(1988)."}
{"id": "19344", "revid": "10227", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19344", "title": "Uwizeye Marc", "text": "Marc Uwizeye, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Rocky Kimomo (yavutse (1991-08-24) yavukiye i kigali mu Rwanda ise ni Nzamurambaho Gerard na nyina Batamuliza Immaculee ni umwanditsi wa filime ndetse agakina filime \u200b\u200b\u200b \nUbuzima bwambere nakazi.\nYatangiye gukina filime kuva muri 2015, kandi azwi cyane mu bikorwa bye, birimo \"Umujinya w\u2019amajwi y\u2019umusirikare\" ndetse n\u2019uruhare yagize mu muziki w\u2019u Rwanda binyuze muri Rocky Entertainment. Mu 2023, Rocky Kimomo yerekanye filime yise \"Umujinya w'umusirikare\" kandi izobereye mu gushushanya.\nRocky Kimomo niwe wateguye uruzinduko rwo gushyigikira gahunda yo gusura u Rwanda binyuze mu byamamare byo mu Rwanda. Yatangiye ubukangurambaga abashishikariza gusura parike zaho, zirimo Parike ya Nyungwe na Parike y\u2019ibirunga na Parike y\u2019igihugu ya Akagera. Kuri ubu Rocky Kimomo akora nka ambasaderi wikirango kuri Itel Mobile. \nAbagiraneza.\nRocky Kimomo atanga inkunga mumiryango y'abagiraneza ikorera mu Karere ka Gasabo. Iyo mfatiro yita ku bana banduye virusi itera SIDA. Yishyura kandi amafaranga yishuri nibikenerwa byibanze, usibye kubatera inkunga. "}
{"id": "19345", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19345", "title": "Umuhire Amelia", "text": "Amelia Umuhire (yavutse 1991) ni umuyobozi wa firime w'u Rwanda ukorera mu Ubudage, akaba ari produce, n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima.\nUmuhire yavukiye i Kigali, mu Rwanda muri 1991. Muri 2015 yayoboye urubuga rwa Polyglot aho yataye mushiki we Amanda Mukasonga nk'umuntu nyamukuru wa firime eshatu zigufi zashyizwe kuri YouTube muri 2015. Uru rukurikirane rwerekanwe mu minsi mikuru mpuzamahanga itandukanye nka Tribeca Film Festival, Festival D'Angers, Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime ngufi Oberhausen hamwe n\u2019ubugeni bw\u2019ubukorikori n\u2019ingoro ndangamurage nka Victoria na Albert Museum. Urukurikirane rwatsindiye \"Urubuga mpuzamahanga rwiza\" mu iserukiramuco Tous Ecrans i Geneve hamwe n\u2019urubuga rwiza rw\u2019Abadage kuri Webfest Berlin. Filime ye ngufi \" Mugabo \" (2017) yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi Rotterdam mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Blackstar aho yatsindiye Filime y'Ikigereranyo Cyiza, Berlin Biennale, MCA Chicago, MOCA Los Angeles mu rwego rwo kwerekana imurikagurisha rya Black Radical Imagination ryateguwe na Darol Kae na Jheanelle Brown. Muri 2018, yayoboye videwo yashinzwe yakoreshejwe nk'igitaramo cyo kuzenguruka isabukuru yimyaka 20 ya \"The Miseducation of Lauryn Hill\". Muri 2018 yanditse, ayobora kandi yandika amajwi \" Vaterland \" yatowe muri Prix Europa. Yerekanye ibikorwa bye nibindi bikorwa byiyongera kuri solo na matsinda i Berlin, Houston, Cologne, Braunschweig, Florence na Kigali. Niwe wegukanye igihembo cya Villa Romana, igihembo cy\u2019ubuhanzi cya kera cyane mu Budage. Yandika kuri TV yo mu Budage kandi akora ibihangano bya videwo, documentaire nibice byamajwi kubantu bumva icyongereza nu Budage.\nIbikorwa bye byerekanwe mu birori byinshi bya firime, birimo MOCA Los Angeles, MCA Chicago, Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Tribeca, Iserukiramuco rya Filime ry\u2019Abanyamerika muri Smithsonian, Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi Rotterdam. "}
{"id": "19346", "revid": "16551", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19346", "title": "Ingabire Pascaline", "text": "Ingabire Pascaline (yavutse 1995), ni umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka mu Rwanda,aho atunganya amafilime akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime yikinamico nka \"Teta\", \"Igikomere\" na \"Samantha\". \nUmwuga.\nIngabire yatangiye gukina afite imyaka ine yambere, aho yahoraga yitabira gukina ku ishuri. Nyuma yo kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye mu 2015, yinjiye muri sinema yo mu Rwanda maze agaragara muri filime nyinshi nka \"Samantha\", \"Teta\", \"Ikiguzi Cy'ka\", \"Igikomere\", \"Nyirabayazana\", \"Inzinga\", \"Umuzirantenge\" na \"Mbirinde\". Nk'umuyobozi, arimo akora urukurikirane rwa YouTube rwitwa \"Inzozi\". Muri 2021, yakinnye muri filime \"Kwikunda\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nPascaline Ingabire yavukiye Kanombe mu mujyi wa Kigali. Yashyingiwe ku ya 30 Nyakanga 2019. Ku ya 16 Mata 2021, yibarukiye umwana mu bitaro bya kaminuza ya Kigali (CHUK), ariko bukeye arapfa. "}
{"id": "19348", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19348", "title": "Habyarimana Jean Luc", "text": "Mitana Jean Luc (yavutse ku ya 29 Nzeri 1983), ni umukinnyi wa firime wu mu Rwanda akaba n'umukinnyi wa sinema. Niwe washinze uruganda rukora firime Filimi rufite icyicaro mu Rwanda. Yabaye umukinnyi wa sinema muri firime zitandukanye zirimo \"Inyuma y'Ijambo\", \"Kai Umucuruzi\" n'imbaraga \"mu bwoba\". umwana wa habyarimana juvena. Muri iki gihe aherereye muri rdc\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 29 Nzeri 1983 i Kigali, mu Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2006, yinjiye muri Almond Tree Films Collective maze muri 2009, Mitana akora kuri filime izwi ku izina rya \"Maibobo\" iyobowe na Yves Montand Niyongabo kandi yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi rya Rotterdam mu 2010. Yatanzwe mu iserukiramuco rya Sinema Africano d'Asia e Amerika Latina ya 2011 i Milan, mu Butaliyani. Yayoboye \"SAA-IPO\" mu 2010. Yarasiwe i Kigali iterwa inkunga na Tribeca Film Institute. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Tribeca 2011 hanyuma ryerekanwa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Durban 2011 ndetse na AfryKamera International Film Festival, Polonye mu 2011. Hanyuma muri 2014, yakoze kuri documentaire \"Inyuma y'Isi\" iyobowe na Marie-Clementine Dusejambo. Muri 2014, yitabiriye Berlinale Talents, aho yari muri Studio yo Guhindura. "}
{"id": "19349", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19349", "title": "Mbabazi Philbert Aim\u00e9", "text": "Philbert Aim\u00e9 Mbabazi Sharangabo (yavutse 1990), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo mu Rwanda. Yakoze filime ngufi zamamaye cyane zirimo, \"Abibohoza\", \"Imirongo\" na \"Nabonye Ibintu Byanjye Ibumoso\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nPhilbert Aim\u00e9 Mbabazi yavutse 1990 mu Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nMbabazi yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami rya sinema yakuye muri kaminuza y\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019ubushakashatsi i Geneve (UMUTWE - Gen\u00e8ve, Haute \u00e9cole d'art et de design) i Geneve. Mugihe cyishuri, yakoze firime ebyiri \"The Liberators\" na \"Versus\". Filime zombi zerekanwe mu birori byinshi bya firime harimo Vision du R\u00e9el Nyon, Internationale Kurzfilmtage Winterthur, Tampere, Oberhausen na Uppsala Festival Festival. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi muri 2017, yasubiye mu Rwanda.\nMuri 2019, yayoboye filime ngufi \"Nabonye Ibintu byanjye n'ibumoso\" yatsindiye igihembo kinini mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Oberhausen. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya firime rirenga 20 nk'Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi rya Rotterdam, International Kurzfilmtage Winterthur, Go Short Nijmegen, Indie Lisboa na ISFF Hamburg, FIFF Namur n'ibindi \nYatangije isosiyete ikora filime yitwa Imitana Productions ifite icyicaro i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Nyuma yaje gukora filime ye yambere yumukobwa \"Republika\". "}
{"id": "19350", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19350", "title": "Ishuri rya Cornerstone Leadership Academy", "text": "Cornerstone Leadership Academy, n'ishuri rihereye mu Akarere ka Rwamagana, Intara y'Uburasirazuba mu Rwanda, ryafunguwe mu 2007, riherereye hejuru y\u2019umusozi ureba ikiyaga cya Muhazi, kuhagera n'iminota 40 uvuye mu mujyi wa Kigali. Iri shuri ryigamo ryakira abahungu n'abakobwa muburyo bumwe bwo kwiga. \nIcyerekezo.\nGuteza imbere uburezi bw'abahungu n'abakobwa hagamijwe kubagira abayobozi beza b'ejo hazaza ku Rwanda. Guharanira ko ubuzima bwabo burangwa n' imico myiza n'imiterere y'ubuyobozi bikubiye mu buzima bwa Yesu.\nImikorere.\nCornerstone Leadership Academy yakira abana 40 buri mwaka biga mu mashami y\u2019Amateka, Ubukungu, n\u2019Ubumenyi bw\u2019Isi (HEG); iry\u2019Ubugenge, Ubutabire n\u2019Ibinyabuzima (PCB); iry\u2019Imibare, Ubutabire n\u2019Ibinyabuzima (MCB) ndetse n\u2019iry\u2019Ibinyabuzima, Ubutabire n\u2019Ubumenyi bw\u2019isi (BCG).\nMu kwigisha, iri shuri rigendera ku nteganyanyigisho ya Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi ariko rikongeraho umwihariko w\u2019amasomo y\u2019ubuyobozi (Leadership Skills) ahabwa abanyeshuri mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka 3 bahamara biga icyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019amashuri yisumbuye, ari na cyo cyonyine kihaba."}
{"id": "19351", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19351", "title": "Kajangwe Armand", "text": "Armand Kajangwe, uyu ni umunyarwanda akaba ari umukinnyi wa firimi uba mu Busuwisi. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime zishimiwe cyane nku \"Ubuhunzi\", na \"Dirty Singles\". \nUmwuga.\nKu ya 7 Mata 2009, Kajangwe yinjiye mu isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa byuzuye yitwa ' Crooked Seas Inc. ' yashinzwe na Craig Leblanc ifite icyicaro i Ontario, muri Kanada. Yakoze nk'umuyobozi, umuyobozi w'amafoto, n'umuyobozi ushinzwe imbuga nkoranyambaga. \nMu mwaka wa 2016, Kajangwe yagize uruhare mu kumurika urubuga rwa mbere rwa Afurika. Ihuriro rizwi ku izina rya 'www.journal.rw' ryatunganijwe kandi riyobowe na Innovation Village, uruganda ruhanga ruherereye mu Rwanda aho Kajangwe ari umuyobozi mukuru. Ihuriro ritanga inzira yo gusangira ibisobanuro bya videwo bihanitse. "}
{"id": "19352", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19352", "title": "Kabera Eric", "text": "Kabera Eric (yavutse muri 1970) ni umunyamakuru wo mu Rwanda akaba n'umukinnyi wa filimi akaba ari na we washinze ikigo cya Sinema mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwambere nakazi.\nEric Kabera, Umunyarwanda, yavukiye muri Zayire, ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC). N'ubwo yari atuye muri RDC igihe itsembabwoko ryo mu Rwanda ryibasiye abatutsi ryatangiraga muri Mata 1994, Kabera yavuze ko abo mu muryango we babaga mu Rwanda icyo gihe, 32 muri bo bapfira mu ihohoterwa. Ibi byamuteye inkunga yo gukora filime yerekanwe mu 2001 ivuga kuri jenoside yiswe \"Iminsi 100\" na documentaire yo mu 2004 yiswe \"Abashinzwe kwibuka\", aho yabajije abahohotewe ndetse n\u2019abakoze ayo mahano. \n\"Iminsi 100\", Kabera yakoze ku bufatanye n\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019amafirime w\u2019Ubwongereza Nick Hughes, ni yo filime ya mbere yafatiwe mu Rwanda nyuma y\u2019itsembabwoko ry\u2019u Rwanda ryakorewe abatutsi mu 1994, kandi ni na filime ya mbere yerekanwe kuri jenoside mbere ya \"Hotel Rwanda\". Iyi filime ntiyakoresheje abakinnyi babigize umwuga, ahubwo abakora amafilime bifashishije abarokotse n\u2019abatutsi n\u2019abahutu kugira ngo bakore iyo nyandiko, kandi yarasiwe ahantu nyaburanga aho ibikorwa bya jenoside byabereye. Abakinnyi bakinnye ni Eric Bridges Twahirwa, Cleophas Kabasita, Davis Kagenza, Mazimpaka Kennedy, Davis Kwizera, David Mulwa, Didier Ndengeyintwali, Denis Nsanzamahoro, na Justin Rusandazangabo. "}
