yo kudakoresha amagambo ateye isoni mu muziki we.\n1985\u20131992: DJ Jazzy Jeff na Fresh Prince.\nSmith yatangiye umwuga we nka MC w\u2019aba DJ babiri ba hip-hop, Jazzy Jeff &amp; the Fresh Prince, hamwe n\u2019inshuti ye yo mu bwana, Jeffrey \"DJ Jazzy Jeff\" Townes, wari umuproducer w\u2019indirimbo. Townes na Smith bahuye bwa mbere mu 1985, ubwo Townes yaririmbaga mu birori byo mu rugo hafi y\u2019aho Smith atuye, maze akabona Smith afite impano yo kuririmba indirimbo. Smith yahisemo kwifatanya na we, maze bombi basangira ubuhanga n\u2019imbaraga mu muziki, bituma Townes abona ko uwo musore afite impano idasanzwe mu kuririmba."}
{"id": "19358", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19358", "title": "Kayitesi Sonia", "text": "Kayitesi Sonia bakunze kwita Dj Sonia yavutse 31 Ukwakira 1998 mu Karere ka Huye, mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda, ise ni Pio Nkubito na mama we yitwa Mathlide Mukarutesi ni umukinnyi wa jockey w'umunyarwanda baba mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda, ni umudamu w\u2019umucuruzi, utegura ibirori, umunyamideli na moderi akaba umukinnyi wa filime.\nUbuzima bwa mbere n'akazi.\nYinjiye mu mwuga wa deejaying kuva muri 2019. Azwi cyane kubikorwa bye muri Muzika yu Rwanda abinyujije mu marushanwa yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi. Yagize uruhare mu birori byo mu Rwanda byo guha izina ingagi yavutse, izwi cyane ku izina rya Kwita Izina. \nSonia yakinnye mu bitaramo byinshi bitandukanye, birimo Silent Disco, Imyidagaduro myiza, Ibihangange byo muri Afurika, Iserukiramuco rya Hill, kandi yakinnye mu mahoteri atandukanye ndetse n'imikino myinshi, harimo na Afrobasket y'Abagore mu Rwanda 2023, FIBA Igikombe cyisi, nahandi henshi. DJ Sonia uri mu ba DJ benshi b'abagore mu kuvanga umuziki i Kigali, yatumiwe mu gitaramo aho yahuye na Darassa akaba ari umwe mu mazina akomeye muri muzika ya Tanzaniya na Masauti akaba ari umwe mu bahanzi bazwi cyane i Nairobi. Kugeza ubu ni umwe mu bavanga imiziki y'ibitangazamakuru byo mu Rwanda, Radio Rwanda, TV y'u Rwanda, n'ishami ryayo rya kabiri, ariryo KC2. \nYakinnye nka Dj igihe abaririmbyi bo muri Nijeriya bombi Davido na Tiwa Savage bagiye mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "19359", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19359", "title": "Umuringa Karemera Carole", "text": "Umuringa KAremera Carole (yavutse 1975) ni umukinnyi akaba ari umunyarwandakazi w\u2019u Rwanda wavukiye mu Bubiligi, umukinnyi w'afilimi wa saxofhone umuyobozi w\u2019ikinamico, umuhanzi utegura ibirori ndetse n\u2019inzobere muri politiki y\u2019umuco.\nUbuzima.\nYavutse mu 1975 i Buruseli, umukobwa w\u2019abanyarwanda bari mu buhungiro. Nkumwana, Carole Karemera yari indashyikirwa mu mibare kandi arota gufungura imigati. Carole Karemera yize muri Royal Conservatory of Theatre na Muzika mu Bubiligi Muri 1994, ise, umunyamakuru, yasubiye mu Bubiligi biturutse kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Carole Karemera yavumbuye u Rwanda mu 1995. \nYakinnye mu makinamico menshi, nka Battlefield ya Peter Brook na Marie-H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Estienne, Twise urukundo na Felwine Sarr, Jaz na Koffi Kwahul\u00e9, Scratchin 'imbere imbere\" na Wim Vandekeybus Umugore wa Bogus' na Kay Adshead, na Anathema na Jacques Delcuvellerie, kandi icyarimwe batangira umwuga we wa sinema Hagati ya 2000 na 2004, yagize uruhare runini mu ikinamico ya Groupov Rwanda 94. Se wabo, Jean-Marie Muyango, umwe mu bahanzi bakomeye bo mu Rwanda gakondo, yahimbye amanota kuri iki gitaramo. \nMu 2005, Carole Karemera yagize uruhare runini hamwe na Idris Elba muri filime ya Raoul Peck \"Rimwe na rimwe muri Mata\", hafi ya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994. Muri uwo mwaka, yahisemo gutura i Kigali. Carole Karemera amaze kwimukira mu gihugu, yagize uruhare mu mishinga y\u2019umuco, harimo isomero rya mbere rigendanwa ry\u2019u Rwanda, ikigo cy\u2019ubuhanzi cya mbere cy\u2019u Rwanda i Kigali ISHYO, Espace Madiba isomero ryeguriwe ubuvanganzo nyafurika na Karayibe ryateguye udukino twifashisha mu tubari no mumihanda yimijyi yu Rwanda, murwego rwo guteza imbere abumva bashya hamwe nabaturage mubuhanzi. Mu 2007, Carole Karemera n'abandi bagore barindwi bashinze ikigo cy\u2019ubuhanzi cya Ishyo i Kigali kugira ngo bashyigikire iterambere ry\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019umuco mu Rwanda. \nKaremera yabaye Umuyobozi w'Inama y'Ubutegetsi mu Kigega Nyafurika cy'Umurage Nyafurika, nk'umunyamabanga mukuru wungirije wa Arterial Network, ndetse n'uhagarariye igihugu cya Arterial Network mu Rwanda. Yakinnye mu mukino \"wa Battlefield\" wa 2016 wa Peter Brook, ashingiye kuri \"Mahabharata\". Muri 2018, yahawe igihembo muri Les Journ\u00e9es th\u00e9\u00e2trales de Carthage, yishimira ibikorwa bye mu ikinamico mu Rwanda no muri Afurika. "}
